t":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:40:43.527Z","repositoryId":1146555686,"sha":"0802a7d26840c434fce399e13d302071502bb461"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:40:43.527Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55053188?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegor","id":55053188,"login":"guilhermegor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDUzMTg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/f95ca2b5688bb0e3b829ab5007b3f4c19a4be205/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:07:20Z","email":"55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guilherme Rodrigues"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:07:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mvc-native): import pandas at runtime so fetch_all passes the checker (#670)\n\n* fix(mvc-native): import pandas at runtime so fetch_all passes the check\n\nExampleEntity carries metaclass=TypeChecker and annotates\nfetch_all -> pd.DataFrame, but pandas was imported only under\nTYPE_CHECKING. Beartype resolves the annotation against module globals\nat call time, so every call raised BeartypeCallHintForwardRefException.\n\nSame defect #661 fixed in mvc-orm. Still annotation-only per\n.layer-policy.yaml.\n\nAdds test_example_entity.py: red before (6 failed), green after\n(1071 passed).\n\nRefs #667.\n\n* docs(coverage): note the mvc-native gain from exercising ExampleEntity\n\nThe native tier row now records 86% unit coverage once ExampleEntity\nruns through the type checker, measured on a generated project with\n1071 tests.\n\nRefs #667.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffa2d9d5508c7f0c2da77deb60e559f6dad653a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/ffa2d9d5508c7f0c2da77deb60e559f6dad653a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/f95ca2b5688bb0e3b829ab5007b3f4c19a4be205","verification":{"payload":"tree ffa2d9d5508c7f0c2da77deb60e559f6dad653a7\nparent d32243aefdd4446c270a33926b3f388531bc4680\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1791457640 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791457640 -0300\n\nfix(mvc-native): import pandas at runtime so fetch_all passes the checker (#670)\n\n* fix(mvc-native): import pandas at runtime so fetch_all passes the check\n\nExampleEntity carries metaclass=TypeChecker and annotates\nfetch_all -> pd.DataFrame, but pandas was imported only under\nTYPE_CHECKING. Beartype resolves the annotation against module globals\nat call time, so every call raised BeartypeCallHintForwardRefException.\n\nSame defect #661 fixed in mvc-orm. Still annotation-only per\n.layer-policy.yaml.\n\nAdds test_example_entity.py: red before (6 failed), green after\n(1071 passed).\n\nRefs #667.\n\n* docs(coverage): note the mvc-native gain from exercising ExampleEntity\n\nThe native tier row now records 86% unit coverage once ExampleEntity\nruns through the type checker, measured on a generated project with\n1071 tests.\n\nRefs #667.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-