5NWNhMmI1Njg4YmIwZTNiODI5YWI1MDA3YjNmNGMxOWE0YmUyMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commit/d32243aefdd4446c270a33926b3f388531bc4680","sha":"d32243aefdd4446c270a33926b3f388531bc4680","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/d32243aefdd4446c270a33926b3f388531bc4680"}],"sha":"f95ca2b5688bb0e3b829ab5007b3f4c19a4be205","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/f95ca2b5688bb0e3b829ab5007b3f4c19a4be205"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55053188?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegor","id":55053188,"login":"guilhermegor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDUzMTg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/d32243aefdd4446c270a33926b3f388531bc4680/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:13:33Z","email":"55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guilherme Rodrigues"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:13:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(mvc-orm): cover the model and pipeline, fix the unbound pd (#617) (#661)\n\n* test(mvc-orm): cover the model and pipeline, fix the unbound pd\n\nA fresh mvc-service-orm-db scaffold measured 76% against the shared floor\nof 80. The uncovered lines were not neglected branches: ExampleEntity imported\npandas under TYPE_CHECKING while carrying the runtime TypeChecker, so beartype\ncould not resolve ''-> pd.DataFrame'' and fetch_all raised on every call. The\nreal run() therefore never worked and nothing exercised the read, render or\nsummary phases (blueprintx#617).\n\nImport pandas for real (annotation-only per the layer policy, as the sibling\nscope_filter_example already does). Add tests for the model against a real\nSQLite file and for every orchestrator phase, one assertion site each; nine of\nthem fail against the old model.\n\n* docs(coverage): record the mvc-service-orm-db gap as closed\n\nReplace the open-gap note with the measured result: 76.10% before, 95.12%\nafter, and the cause (an unbound pd, not neglected branches) (#617).\n\n* fix(scaffold): drop single-pipeline phases test under multi-intent\n\nmulti-intent removes _pipeline.py, but test_pipeline_phases.py still\nimported it, failing the mvc-orm multi-intent job (blueprintx#617).\n\n* fix(templates): address ladder review on the mvc-orm coverage tests\n\nYield fixtures typed Iterator[Engine] with a Yields section, run()\nfailure asserted with pytest.raises, log lines checked independently,\ndtype compared to the module dict, rationale comment cut to a pointer.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"220c558626d38a1c43e5a5c3bdf46300be9e8983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/220c558626d38a1c43e5a5c3bdf46300be9e8983"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/d32243aefdd4446c270a33926b3f388531bc4680","verification":{"payload":"tree 220c558626d38a1c43e5a5c3bdf46300be9e8983\nparent 4ab3982b7226294a45295203c7cfdce441f7df32\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1791436413 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791436413 -0300\n\ntest(mvc-orm): cover the model and pipeline, fix the unbound pd (#617) (#661)\n\n* test(mvc-orm): cover the model and pipeline, fix the unbound pd\n\nA fresh mvc-service-orm-db scaffold measured 76% against the shared floor\nof 80. The uncovered lines were not neglected branches: ExampleEntity imported\npandas under TYPE_CHECKING while carrying the runtime TypeChecker, so beartype\ncould not resolve ''-> pd.DataFrame'' and fetch_all raised on every call. The\nreal run() therefore never worked and nothing exercised the read, render or\nsummary phases (blueprintx#617).\n\nImport pandas for real (annotation-only per the layer policy, as the sibling\nscope_filter_example already does). Add tests for the model against a real\nSQLite file and for every orchestrator phase, one assertion site each; nine of\nthem fail against the old model.\n\n* docs(coverage): record the mvc-service-orm-db gap as closed\n\nReplace the open-gap note with the measured result: 76.10% before, 95.12%\nafter, and the cause (an unbound pd, not neglected branches) (#617).\n\n* fix(scaffold): drop single-pipeline phases test under multi-intent\n\nmulti-intent removes _pipeline.py, but test_pipeline_phases.py still\nimported it, failing the mvc-orm multi-intent job (blueprintx#617).\n\n* fix(templates): address ladder review on the mvc-orm coverage tests\n\nYield fixtures typed Iterator[Engine] with a Yields section, run()\nfailure asserted with pytest.raises, log lines checked independently,\ndtype compared to the module dict, rationale comment cut to a pointer.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxyZ9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZNMQAAjbq4se5vNF+saxJ4Aeqihm\nf2QpKDVAVtLNku6B4jK7X8Gn0WrNPo1XroCeW4e5QWPz1d9xUWIQoHXVPOEKnmA0\nnu2XWdRwNCBl7aAoGDzESOnIr+S3lcxMvKt9Ba5R9VkcWYGBnMkFGAEyhjV7o9hF\n5czuGtYd0zdloWWcl4uhKH/eAD8LgaLEv6LedJcihY6BWyBeZ/PTQDahVEV4q99V\nThX6J1sYjFU7C6wx