 GPG key rotation caveat.\n\nCloses #448\n\n* docs(env): safer GPG export, no exported secrets, chmod 600\n\nLadder review of #474: source .env without set -a so the secrets are\nnot exported into gh''s environment, export the GPG key to a umask-077 file\ninstead of the terminal, and chmod 600 an existing .env.\n\n* docs(env): refuse empty or placeholder secret uploads\n\nA failed source or a typo in the name sent an empty string to gh secret\nset, replacing a working secret. Guard the source, the unset name and the\nplaceholder in the command itself, export the GPG key via mktemp outside\nthe work tree, and delete a stale passphrase on rotation.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"71b0b82f180dbdad2357f186b97093fd1749cbf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/71b0b82f180dbdad2357f186b97093fd1749cbf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/e663e007589958d78a81549da1e47a60972e23bf","verification":{"payload":"tree 71b0b82f180dbdad2357f186b97093fd1749cbf0\nparent 28d94fea4f1a1eb42b4d3916ef8782df43a9327c\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1791413108 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791413108 -0300\n\nfeat(env): document Actions secrets in .env.example (#474)\n\n* feat(env): document Actions secrets in .env.example\n\n- .env.example lists every Actions secret with its consumer workflows,\n  including the Snap Store credential.\n- CONTRIBUTING.md gains a secrets table with minimum scopes and the\n  re-provisioning steps: subshell load, stdin upload, mode 600 bootstrap,\n  single-quote escaping and the GPG key rotation caveat.\n\nCloses #448\n\n* docs(env): safer GPG export, no exported secrets, chmod 600\n\nLadder review of #474: source .env without set -a so the secrets are\nnot exported into gh''s environment, export the GPG key to a umask-077 file\ninstead of the terminal, and chmod 600 an existing .env.\n\n* docs(env): refuse empty or placeholder secret uploads\n\nA failed source or a typo in the name sent an empty string to gh secret\nset, replacing a working secret. Guard the source, the unset name and the\nplaceholder in the command itself, export the GPG key via mktemp outside\nthe work tree, and delete a stale passphrase on rotation.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxst0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAp1gQAFqQPLlMeo+QdW/kUFxXgcc/\nZ1gV0SMIWN5E+D9SctzhzcMJIJS6jYmy+nQqIgl6gSzXOrgyuf2tfg6Gf5i/iAOf\niNF3H6+lpMpm/mMZKnbg0+NMPHr2jcn2J8kgx0/EY9/hvXP74vGlZPvAmlDRJ866\nYdokM2ufqUlVbAb1oVETIb+ipKswZeR4Kx/+RQgtGBmc/lrPjKbl/QPG1WIYJ/k/\nvNqTtuaQzr647mtxLdqdRzyMr+Uxw596TRQqjomWvmiZI1wRwKKDI2nV6phsUgjM\nNWIU+4JCJgXdATpGaWOraLylPOHraTvODAEQqT051ff1BTlv7xZpwJ0D4h6iuUAb\nbN4D78I4orvMF83g2gxqjYwT5m8r9fCsgGgX8KqOGSRPeJQDqEnlSa2PWsnaxCpa\n2UdlN7bPDSdCUDcX+5YT/psoCquk2ETp2HlatXBFcmZohBI01zT0cHSnT5G/0eO9\nKfM3gUZ7IZJjJOIzzrmpr52rBz6j9BXbfuwjf7qik0BMD3wOEhHklsY2zyeOlm26\nQVX2Lis1WVVea4S+YJ4x0jQZx9VWW5obC8TzK3YBc8tESgVkl+sWkl4rKgo+/M2q\nhZ1dGqOV1maY2eW6t6PXVUshR5H7MNhTEz7XCNKAx1If0LkaweWOM+U4rrI0l638\nEFqC6uaB2pJJ4FEkiTJu\n=5OpT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T22:45:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commit/e663e007589958d78a81549da1e47a60972e23bf","node_id":"C_kwDORFcNJtoAKGU2NjNlMDA3NTg5OTU4ZDc4YTgxNTQ5ZGExZTQ3YTYwOTcyZTIzYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commit/28d94fea4f1a1eb42b4d3916ef8782df43a9327c","sha":"28d94fea4f1a1eb42b4d3916ef8782df43a9327c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/28d94fea4f1a1eb42b4d3916ef8782df43a9327c"}],"sha":"e663e007589958d78a81549da1e47a60972e23bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/e663e007589958d78a81549da1e47a60972e23bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55053188?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegor","id":55053188,"login":"guilhermegor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDUzMTg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/28d94fea4f1a1eb42b4d3916ef8782df43a9327c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:31:44Z","email":"55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guilherme Rodrigues"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:31:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(templates): close native DB connections, validate SQL names (#653)\n\n* fix(templates): close SQLite/MSSQL connections, validate SQL names\n\nsqlite3 and pyodbc connections used as ''with conn:'' commit but never\nclose, so every handler call leaked one. Wrap them in closing() in the\nSQLite and SQL Server handlers; psycopg, mysql.connector and oracledb\nalready close in __exit__ (read from each driver''s source).\n\nValidate table and id_field once, in every handler constructor, against\n[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]* via a shared helper, and do the same for the MVC\nexample entity''s table name.\n\nNote.created_at now uses an aware UTC default instead of utcnow.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FSNxnx3xHEyT49GBNg6XF6\n\n* fix(templates): apply the #646 handler fixes to the api tier, document\n\nSame closing() and constructor identifier validation as the ddd tier in\nthe api-service-native-db handlers, plus the aware-UTC Note default and\ncopies of the witness tests. The SQLite online backup there opened two\nconnections and closed neither; both are closed now.\n\nMake the identifier regex private so __all__ completeness holds, and\ndocument both rules in python-common/CLAUDE.md.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FSNxnx3xHEyT49GBNg6XF6\n\n* fix(templates): use timezone.utc for Note.created_at, fix docs\n\nZoneInfo(''UTC'') needs tz data at runtime, which Windows lacks without\nthe tzdata package. Use the stdlib timezone.utc in the api, ddd-native\nand ddd-orm entities, and update the two skeleton docs pages that still\nshowed datetime.utcnow.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FSNxnx3xHEyT49GBNg6XF6\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"13c711a2f29838b50c5752212cc1a838fdb5b713","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/13c711a2f29838b50c5752212cc1a838fdb5b713"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/28d94fea4f1a1eb42b4d3916ef8782df43a9327c","verification":{"payload":"tree 13c711a2f29838b50c5752212cc1a838fdb5b713\nparent e8b4ad5d3026b16ffe9bb726652541ed698fc1be\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1791412304 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791412304 -0300\n\nfix(templates): close native DB connections, validate SQL names (#653)\n\n* fix(templates): close SQLite/MSSQL connections, validate SQL names\n\nsqlite3 and pyodbc connections used as ''with conn:'' commit but never\nclose, so every handler call leaked one. Wrap them in closing() in the\nSQLite and SQL Server handlers; psycopg, mysql.connector and oracledb\nalready close in __exit__ (read from each driver''s source).\n\nValidate table and id_field once, in every handler constructor, against\n[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]* via a shared helper, and do the same for the MVC\nexample entity''s table name.\n\nNote.created_at now uses an aware UTC default instead of utcnow.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FSNxnx3xHEyT49GBNg6XF6\n\n* fix(templates): apply the #646 handler fixes to the api tier, document\n\nSame closing() and constructor identifier validation as the ddd tier in\nthe api-service-native-db handlers, plus the aware-UTC Note default and\ncopies of the witness tests. The SQLite online backup there opened two\nconnections and closed neither; both are closed now.\n\nMake the identifier regex private so __all__ completeness holds, and\ndocument both rules in python-common/CLAUDE.md.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FSNxnx3xHEyT49GBNg6XF6\n\n* fix(templates): use timezone.utc for Note.created_at, fix docs\n\nZoneInfo(''UTC'') needs tz data at runtime, which Windows lacks without\nthe tzdata package. Use the stdlib timezone.utc in the api, ddd-native\nand ddd-orm entities, and update the two skeleton docs pages that still\nshowed datetime.utcnow.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FSNxnx3xHEyT49GBNg6XF6\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxshQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiWgQAErZYqVBInYVQrmkGY4TTP15\nk9gFKVt4myKq5QvhF+4AEc05upN4JbJrMcEtplehU2FG5HDcFI9NFgi8vjYOhp3y\ni5qsH54kN8cTBZ80dlTzNjjiqSkip+dVodZQR/0hxmnOUq+P5OIgu1WrXL04rAGM\nnIldi9OWWOIo9/HyBerZy+K8FRH/prIhF9V/P8t3vOtvb23j+7aq+5dYOEKfv37N\nc2D783GtzJ+rwc9v2j8uZLckIWJkro4neHEejSVlRN06zJgbQAevuwINaxJ69gxs\nYFdabnNNFIo2NAQFKVxy77uOyKx8PjzukEN9+LHT4hJz5Pso2RuG3U3zgT8Ng7WC\nx1x2qly8KKUFHDeVqcqf4TMtAD9rZllTQMTOVVK8U78r29FpHPlTAF6iqetV+Sxj\nTew9mWKdbAT11XVOsGxxBgEXIEis93raueGmAGExpZsK2p/yDz8XMsZ7IA7Oo9CD\nG2tHRTAVEYvhCur+vDLrg+6mzlpGrGawy6X+swWYJy4upfb9/E93ccjCbsrg0fpi\nceEKrMyRGruWJTu/Z6chGWqVF18WVSkKxGKBrWgQ/2gSqUANf0amvwQzTN8ik7KQ\nebM7AjaOGuUv7Bh/ZcONcxLi9GXn/WttLPE7hzJIfcNxqz603arkLUiJXwX9apr9\nSNrFsM8q2WslWXZY7yrH\n=YYNq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T22:31:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://