spec_answers.sh.\n\nCloses #647\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FSNxnx3xHEyT49GBNg6XF6\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"08fa8df43f861150f915f3cd710afbecea3cd708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/08fa8df43f861150f915f3cd710afbecea3cd708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/bc3b70d9bd2659a8fbcd8f881562088d64398686","verification":{"payload":"tree 08fa8df43f861150f915f3cd710afbecea3cd708\nparent 489c29b1185105e2fa2ed187429aa64ac3c53fde\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1791396540 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791396540 -0300\n\ntest(ci): wire docs-locale hook to scaffolds, report prompt failures (#651)\n\nThe hook skipped a commit that edited only bin/scaffold/python_*.sh, the\nscripts the test greps for the DOCS_LOCALE default and envsubst list.\nAdd them to files: and the blank line before spec-answers-tests.\n\nUnder set -euo pipefail a failing prompt aborted the test with no FAIL\nline. Capture the exit code and report it through fail, per case.\n\nMake the test executable, like its sibling test_spec_answers.sh.\n\nCloses #647\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FSNxnx3xHEyT49GBNg6XF6\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxoq8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgIEQAGvKhck3FG5Nmz7f4GgQTc59\n7SWNFUlxjqSH+veJylR4UTstAPDp2m42wG8sp/vx46g7McZEz0HeCokNqbjOIDxe\njCIV7XFQfbpJQk4+8Am2RpGKUBM2PJ1P6ZK/d7Mc7PVySyr/DDThgxRWORFOirKL\n2B1a0ozeQ+mxbfjTFGWKIQk9QlcFSggQmhwgZd6taRoBu9YRLIhxjRBeIB2FZxEU\nkMQlLkNA9JpdGKwKJfugrl0e3g4xrzv9O+V/LDGKICaOovMEWOzBcQ5aJ8YdHA2+\n+001C8TcWRZqu3nW4C7oXYOhnO1vBjOQf5mlMS++ZnnYo1+aajmDTIJQgV7HC7AJ\nY5sHWn3RvVWZ3n68vkO3ugD3ORTfn5JDkEhFp9F5o/pDClrnOCnnMFeOpoUwafh3\nzDiKKrvsk3rD8dT93J2i+lRDI4LnmM/Pr/Q4VGEi/qBSkjB8XhCWovb29j5JfvpB\nDP1vnfuPkbDEdqsGSjxueNcNW/9C+o7v09KEQVDNWQ+RUtdaY6MlEPR1PBS