67b498389add14d82ac8e89f10a7e903f243bd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/267b498389add14d82ac8e89f10a7e903f243bd9"}],"sha":"8c62390a8bd9701f349ac4cede404200fdc08e76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/8c62390a8bd9701f349ac4cede404200fdc08e76"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55053188?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermegor","id":55053188,"login":"guilhermegor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDUzMTg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/267b498389add14d82ac8e89f10a7e903f243bd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:08:00Z","email":"55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guilherme Rodrigues"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:08:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"style(lib-minimal): reindent the tier''s Python with spaces (#445) (#579)\n\nW191 (tab indentation) is what #419 named as the blocker for the\nrepo-wide 4-space convention, and lib-minimal was the tier still\ncarrying it.\n\n⚠️ The issue and my own first brief both said the files were under\ntemplates/lib-minimal/tests/. That directory does not exist. The tier''s\ntests ship as .tmpl files under rendered/, which is why a search in\ntests/ found nothing and why PR #555 — the five-tier reindent — shows\nzero files there. Measured on origin/main:\n\n  rendered/test_typing.py.tmpl        38 tab-led lines\n  rendered/test_main.py.tmpl           4\n  rendered/package__init__.py.tmpl     2\n  main.py                              2\n\nA tab in a .tmpl is not cosmetic: the file is rendered verbatim into a\ngenerated project, so it becomes a tab in real user code, and the\nproject''s own ruff then rejects it.\n\nEach file was checked for significant tabs (heredoc bodies, Makefile\nrecipes, verbatim placeholders) before expanding. All four are plain\nPython. Whitespace-only: `git diff --numstat` reports 2/2, 2/2, 4/4 and\n38/38, and `git diff -w --numstat` is empty.\n\n.vscode/tasks.json keeps its 130 tab-led lines on purpose — JSON, not\nPython, so W191 does not apply and reindenting editor config is scope\nthis issue never asked for.\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc75be007cf072beafdb8c31e4749a93a348fb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/cc75be007cf072beafdb8c31e4749a93a348fb27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/267b498389add14d82ac8e89f10a7e903f243bd9","verification":{"payload":"tree cc75be007cf072beafdb8c31e4749a93a348fb27\nparent b227b730b13acf916cc383ebf63358637bd39dd5\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1791349680 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791349680 -0300\n\nstyle(lib-minimal): reindent the tier''s Python with spaces (#445) (#579)\n\nW191 (tab indentation) is what #419 named as the blocker for the\nrepo-wide 4-space convention, and lib-minimal was the tier still\ncarrying it.\n\n⚠️ The issue and my own first brief both said the files were under\ntemplates/lib-minimal/tests/. That directory does not exist. The tier''s\ntests ship as .tmpl files under rendered/, which is why a search in\ntests/ found nothing and why PR #555 — the five-tier reindent — shows\nzero files there. Measured on origin/main:\n\n  rendered/test_typing.py.tmpl        38 tab-led lines\n  rendered/test_main.py.tmpl           4\n  rendered/package__init__.py.tmpl     2\n  main.py                              2\n\nA tab in a .tmpl is not cosmetic: the file is rendered verbatim into a\ngenerated project, so it becomes a tab in real user code, and the\nproject''s own ruff then rejects it.\n\nEach file was checked for significant tabs (heredoc bodies, Makefile\nrecipes, verbatim placeholders) before expanding. All four are plain\nPython. Whitespace-only: `git diff --numstat` reports 2/2, 2/2, 4/4 and\n38/38, and `git diff -w --numstat` is empty.\n\n.vscode/tasks.json keeps its 130 tab-led lines on purpose — JSON, not\nPython, so W191 does not apply and reindenting editor config is scope\nthis issue never asked for.\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxdOwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADX0QAARXWwKqyFdHXZ07T4gkV/DN\nKVMLTjtcM1IDVIKvpZjGT/h1XMwE3z5ke3GqDGmlhC6N+PN59UF3RNJmWYETIVHS\nqu284HJiLyi8N8BlRNbyjiweRMQqu0b61bMyo+ERobbR99FyjXFydd3uIrdvnhzX\nbpPQ7nHAyTklui7Jm9Q0xauEyxHhYMKly9kPgx4CSAqoyDZgn9/6OvvCAbzU8lJW\nDfji3i0S3v/sw2N5dA3BxyE8kVpsLx9WcK6f37sDSVp5pT7uMECY17CFe1hKpPLm\nqXpHCiQ1ucL4FvrjC6WMsj4jPiEn3RAZgsz2C0FyznQ9SbqPEvzadbpBExYn1SA5\npwH3yINSLXKaQ9ivzm6nOcuZDbrOCchnYT69N7TPAgqsOFgcySb3ImdIaSsm7dB4\nNMdcdPVfCvCyVY8oNIjY21hFXc2npICCHvjtNW+bLMwZx8tUiIGRy2djGSt26yhS\nvYCIczGd9QdikdzPjBSePMMJHbQWbTiITNnHytcBDt0lTqgGa4G2KwjYicEmDGMa\n/EYLbUBlmwiQXPmh05H9KLLgnyO8c20Qs1KgrwOjZUCziZxspy4FMzSiwh9NKJpq\nETX0b/dERi0JYA2axlVA+fbdWWNX1BBBTHlgZts+T+Fu5zXY6nfdR7qtVmTye9Nd\noPw/qaM1bjlHa/vCIUkS\n=FwXp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T05:08:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten