":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDUzMTg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/312308302c5d5a441ea2d08b462b933326c8a886/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:12:20Z","email":"55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guilherme Rodrigues"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:12:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: ignore the generated lessons mirror at its current path (#501)\n\n* chore: ignore the generated lessons mirror at its current path\n\nThe mirror generator writes .specs/_lessons/, but .gitignore still named\nonly the old docs/*-lessons.md paths — the location moved and the ignore\nrules did not follow. Running the generator in this repo therefore left\nan untracked, generated file that the uncommitted-worktree guard reports\nas interrupted work, inviting someone to commit an artifact that CLAUDE.md\nsays is git-ignored and never hand-edited.\n\nIgnores the directory rather than each filename, so a new backport store\ndoes not arrive untracked and unnoticed. .specs/ itself stays tracked --\nit holds real design docs. The old docs/ paths are kept so an older\ncheckout still carrying them does not surface them either.\n\n* chore: give the legacy lessons-mirror ignores an exit, fix stale path\n\nReview: the old docs/ ignore lines had no removal condition, and the\ncodespell comment still named the pre-move mirror paths.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"7dfacfdd89e4f38df38dd487edf0aca921eba757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/7dfacfdd89e4f38df38dd487edf0aca921eba757"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/312308302c5d5a441ea2d08b462b933326c8a886","verification":{"payload":"tree 7dfacfdd89e4f38df38dd487edf0aca921eba757\nparent a4c079b1610002bdd232319e110d4a844fbf40cc\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1791198740 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791198740 +0000\n\nchore: ignore the generated lessons mirror at its current path (#501)\n\n* chore: ignore the generated lessons mirror at its current path\n\nThe mirror generator writes .specs/_lessons/, but .gitignore still named\nonly the old docs/*-lessons.md paths — the location moved and the ignore\nrules did not follow. Running the generator in this repo therefore left\nan untracked, generated file that the uncommitted-worktree guard reports\nas interrupted work, inviting someone to commit an artifact that CLAUDE.md\nsays is git-ignored and never hand-edited.\n\nIgnores the directory rather than each filename, so a new backport store\ndoes not arrive untracked and unnoticed. .specs/ itself stays tracked --\nit holds real design docs. The old docs/ paths are kept so an older\ncheckout still carrying them does not surface them either.\n\n* chore: give the legacy lessons-mirror ignores an exit, fix stale path\n\nReview: the old docs/ ignore lines had no removal condition, and the\ncodespell comment still named the pre-move mirror paths.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw4YUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYDcQAHxlbFE089+Oip3n5oU65Ihb\nXDbbw3OlyDl+b8j59I5yDuuJmIpUouMiXl097grUIs90oHZj8lok+u2RGpek8oF0\noWo0TFmhSbx0eXCcRKBgIaAjvJet/NBCXYaq+7O1He8kApACxh+bOzsA3iwelPVg\nwQBA449uio352I78V40TT/sUAdUL82l7lpEZpwRw2NEkh6xOFVkvLtWxLEUoAYtf\nDrOh/Gx4YqRB0Vmd7QbuLN2R