ub.com/users/guilhermegor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/60bac148d8e58eadaf80fcfb06aec942b95567b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:03:21Z","email":"55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guilherme Rodrigues"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:03:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(templates): one assert per unit test outside python-common (#586)\n\n* test(templates): one assert per unit test outside python-common\n\nSplits the 6 multi-assert unit tests that sit outside\ntemplates/python-common/tests/unit/ (held by PR #581).\n\n- mvc-service-native-db / mvc-service-orm-db test_scope_filter_example.py:\n  the 5-assert active run and the 3-assert no-op run each become a shared\n  fixture (tuple_active_run / tuple_inactive_run) plus one-assert tests; the\n  three frozen price counts are one parametrized assertion over attributes\n  rather than three copies of the setup.\n- optional/email test_email_handlers.py: both 2-assert factory tests were the\n  same assertion over two backend keys, so they become parametrize cases.\n\nNo gate is armed here - the pre-commit hook stays at stages: [manual] until\nthe repo-wide count reaches zero.\n\nPart of #544\n\n* test(templates): compare the whole inactive frame, not its length\n\nThe inactive-run test passed if a row changed but two rows came back.\nAssert the full frame against the input values; still one assert.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":