ates ran on the pre-commit leg only, excused by two exemptions in\nbin/precommit_ci_parity_exemptions.txt that named blueprintx#510 as the\ndeferral. Add the matching jobs to scaffold_checks.yml and drop the two\nnow-false exemptions, so the parity gate itself is what keeps them wired.\n\nNeither gate resolves a tool it might not find (one is bash over the\nscaffold libs, the other stdlib ast/re), so neither needs a *_REQUIRED\noverride the way check_actions.sh does.\n\nCloses #510\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquKkkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2yIQAJ3rl3hnC6DuWACz9FPSAXww\ngVa6gmPZjhxs7471ce0huK+jPJ7wUq1rT3sAsXF8JUdDvClyAhOP9h16joArMIuK\njFkEpja3juagb2CyieSv9fy06P0BjMvR2bwyvU9rtAHULMZgMUHHdL0wvuT+aGKk\n+Kw7SmRDETtx76FaAwugsxy6laujvLxk5/lMV3j/bHyqXzzCB+2zkAb547hM16QZ\nN7sFr+DDDosvk2DKDzHDTAHfTZyNvFNDDsttDQfIXc4IqODltAMaWAYMvYSb5jUA\nlCDML1sCt3hkcNTRiTg8GD9hkCDByl/lcKiryiHsHvLkfdQlKt5OM869uhYwSKFd\nocDUIL6RaX6O7wA5tCuBaIipBGKQHO6Sc4Q9QhGSs2mPBQXGPIZzz2rcro1+JHeu\n6yFGmMGqus7yYNxV1pARtHOOgVNhdkroSSCl9Lm049et8EmDRVXWAhXCVI5O/r/j\nTUYpV+Nje5L6ZDTiQvBe9fUkL/l2om1nKrHyrQ+qMmNwUNSWMp6xB/F0ftqJCJsE\nSC2FyQtK1YKP693ATaZiLIUSqmrM1yDQAVYGJcPAbqvsaERTvAJHCG9zo/ngWDus\n3i9YLH2rWS1VXI0SfYFrce6Crl7pk4XQ+1ElFc7cF9HBcIMz7KAIWgA6gByEqG+2\nNz1vDfl+JJ5YHWha8Hcn\n=Pdm3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T05:27:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","receive