053188,"login":"guilhermegor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDUzMTg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermegor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/commits/249efa3c62a3dc679c3241df36d70f5409e51f10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T19:14:42Z","email":"55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guilherme Rodrigues"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T19:14:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(ci): pin this repo''s own 57 action references + docs_version/docs.yaml by SHA (#570) (#578)\n\n* chore(ci): pin this repo''s own 57 action references by SHA (#570)\n\nEvery remote action reference in .github/workflows/ is now\n<owner>/<repo>@<40-hex sha> # vX.Y.Z, the shape Dependabot''s\ngithub-actions ecosystem keeps current. Each SHA was resolved from the\nreal tag via the GitHub API and verified to resolve before landing.\n\ncoderabbit_trigger.yml is untouched (owned by PR #577); it carries no\nuses: reference, so nothing was deferred by skipping it. The four\n./.github/workflows/*.yml reusable-workflow calls are local refs and\nare deliberately left unpinned.\n\n* chore(ci): pin the 3 action references in docs_version/docs.yaml (#570)\n\ndocs_version/docs.yaml is a shipped workflow that discover_workflows\nnever lists, so #369''s gate could not see it, yet five\nbin/scaffold/python_*.sh copy it to the generated project''s\n.github/workflows/docs.yaml. Pinning it stops every new Python project\ninheriting three floating tags. Teaching the gate to discover it lives\nin bin/ci/check_actions.sh, which PR #572 owns.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab01f43d526aac4ab62c6af94f8c63234caaba1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/ab01f43d526aac4ab62c6af94f8c63234caaba1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/249efa3c62a3dc679c3241df36d70f5409e51f10","verification":{"payload":"tree ab01f43d526aac4ab62c6af94f8c63234caaba1f\nparent c53304c26843de232b0daf687d9bac85553514a6\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1790450082 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790450082 +0000\n\nchore(ci): pin this repo''s own 57 action references + docs_version/docs.yaml by SHA (#570) (#578)\n\n* chore(ci): pin this repo''s own 57 action references by SHA (#570)\n\nEvery remote action reference in .github/workflows/ is now\n<owner>/<repo>@<40-hex sha> # vX.Y.Z, the shape Dependabot''s\ngithub-actions ecosystem keeps current. Each SHA was resolved from the\nreal tag via the GitHub API and verified to resolve before landing.\n\ncoderabbit_trigger.yml is untouched (owned by PR #577); it carries no\nuses: reference, so nothing was deferred by skipping it. The four\n./.github/workflows/*.yml reusable-workflow calls are local refs and\nare deliberately left unpinned.\n\n* chore(ci): pin the 3 action references in docs_version/docs.yaml (#570)\n\ndocs_version/docs.yaml is a shipped workflow that discover_workflows\nnever lists, so #369''s gate could not see it, yet five\nbin/scaffold/python_*.sh copy it to the generated project''s\n.github/workflows/docs.yaml. Pinning it stops every new Python project\ninheriting three floating tags. Teaching the gate to discover it lives\nin bin/ci/check_actions.sh, which PR #572 owns.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquBmiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZEIQAB3Bhb