me\nshared function.\n\nddd-service-native-db/CLAUDE.md is held by another open PR; its\npointer lands in a separate follow-up commit to isolate the conflict.\n\n* docs(templates): point ddd-native root CLAUDE.md at PRINCIPLES.md (#540)\n\nSeparate commit because this file is held by another open PR — keeps\nthat conflict small and isolated from the rest of #540.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"20e3b14e3f26db92ab038d5fa0ea4c645e97ee6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/20e3b14e3f26db92ab038d5fa0ea4c645e97ee6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/80053287143d4c4ec4b0760b61fc33522a5701b5","verification":{"payload":"tree 20e3b14e3f26db92ab038d5fa0ea4c645e97ee6d\nparent bdeb420e877e29b50505ff4e70833af0e67527fe\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1789862030 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789862030 +0000\n\nfeat(templates): ship SRP/actor-cohesion principles (#540) (#556)\n\n* feat(templates): ship SRP/actor-cohesion principles (#540)\n\nAdd templates/common/PRINCIPLES.md: SRP actor-cohesion, one-job-per\n-function, verb/noun naming, no hidden side effects, CQS, and one\nlevel of abstraction (Clean Architecture ch.7 + Clean Code ch.2-3).\n\nWire a cp line into all 8 scaffolds (5 Python, 2 TS, bash-cli) and\npoint each skeleton root CLAUDE.md at it via @PRINCIPLES.md, verified\nto resolve with a live claude -p import test.\n\nSplit ts_lib.sh''s copy_common_templates (over the 60-line ceiling\nafter the new cp line) and add SHARED_TEMPLATE_ROOT to the\nreview-bot-roster-optout gate''s stub env, which exercises the same\nshared function.\n\nddd-service-native-db/CLAUDE.md is held by another open PR; its\npointer lands in a separate follow-up commit to isolate the conflict.\n\n* docs(templates): point ddd-native root CLAUDE.md at PRINCIPLES.md (#540)\n\nSeparate commit because this file is held by another 