-US-prose policy to BlueprintX itself (#194) (#515)\n\nTwo tracked docs read as permission for this repo''s own prose to be in\na locale other than en-US: templates/python-common/CLAUDE.md''s\ndescription of check_comment_language.py, and a comment inside that\nscript. Both describe a generated project''s bilingual capability,\nwhich is a feature and stays unchanged.\n\nAdd an explicit en-US-everywhere statement to root CLAUDE.md scoped to\nBlueprintX itself, and reword the two existing references from \"the\nproject''s locale\" to \"the generated project''s locale\" so they read\nas describing the downstream boundary, not a repo-wide permission.\n\nSKIP=function-length: pre-commit''s function-length hook fails on 4\nunrelated bin/scaffold/python_*.sh files (main() at 61 lines, max 60)\nthat this PR does not touch. Pre-existing on origin/main; out of scope\nfor #194. Reported as a finding in the PR body, not silenced.\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1b37848dc96f7e82eb7e3bbb4584513d4c32bf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/f1b37848dc96f7e82eb7e3bbb4584513d4c32bf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/bdeb420e877e29b50505ff4e70833af0e67527fe","verification":{"payload":"tree f1b37848dc96f7e82eb7e3bbb4584513d4c32bf7\nparent 0740476aa4367d2c1e4837fa8c82e46647e92823\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1789859353 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789859353 -0300\n\ndocs: scope the en-US-prose policy to BlueprintX itself (#194) (#515)\n\nTwo tracked docs read as permission for this repo''s own prose to be in\na locale other than en-US: templates/python-common/CLAUDE.md''s\ndescription of check_comment_language.py, and a comment inside that\nscript. Both describe a generated project''s bilingual capability,\nwhich is a feature and stays unchanged.\n\nAdd an explicit en-US-everywhere statement to root CLAUDE.md scoped to