solved via PL adoption; FBT/T20/PTH/\nDTZ/ARG still ungated), confirm check_complexity.sh and\ncheck_layer_imports.py now cover the two gaps the issue cited as\nunresolved, and measure the ones that remain real: dead code,\nduplication, branch coverage, and mutation testing. No gate, config,\nor template file changes — audit only, with the exact command and\noutput recorded per finding.\n\n* fix(tests): drop two decorative banners that turned main red (#303)\n\nThe comment-budget gate runs `--root .` with `pass_filenames: false`, so a\nsingle finding anywhere blocks every commit on every branch that has merged\nmain, and reds the `comment-budget` job on every open PR. Measured on\n`origin/main`: 2 findings, both banners in this file, shipped with #537.\n\nBoth banners restate their test''s own docstring, which already says more, so\nthis is a pure deletion. Gate now reports 528 files checked, 0 findings; the\nfile''s 15 tests still pass.\n\n* docs(ci): say the #432 registry is in flight, not shipped (#169)\n\nThe audit read as if `quality-rules.yaml` were already validating on\n`main`, which would make the current gate look stronger than it is.\n#432''s registry is still on its own open PR, so nothing can be\nregistered in it yet.\n\nRewrites both sites, not only the one flagged: the Part 2 table row said\n\"the mechanism exists\" with the same overstatement as the\nfollow-up list.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"27c610e1ef0efe233f09895d7fdc598ebc2ea8cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/27c610e1ef0efe233f09895d7fdc598ebc2ea8cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/7035a0bac8ac6f51052f9e9e3a343718c48a3f1b","verification":{"payload":"tree 27c610e1ef0efe233f09895d7fdc598ebc2ea8cd\nparent 1ce1be57e7c13b1593265dd19da70f98a692973c\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1789846100 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.