nCloses #256\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XivhWbApyVDfvG6GGjo6xK\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","tree":{"sha":"1239decf84995fca5622aa72acd1fee7ec8c2c14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/trees/1239decf84995fca5622aa72acd1fee7ec8c2c14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guilhermegor/blueprintx/git/commits/72647c30709151b50fb6d64025c89a88630d7436","verification":{"payload":"tree 1239decf84995fca5622aa72acd1fee7ec8c2c14\nparent 3bf4c3dd588327ac512ce97ff3285ab7563a48c2\nauthor Guilherme Rodrigues <55053188+guilhermegor@users.noreply.github.com> 1789775651 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789775651 +0000\n\nfix(bin): paint the banner and tagline in the logo''s two-tone palette (#516)\n\nassets/logo.png is teal BLUEPRINT + pink X, but show_banner() painted the\nwhole wordmark CYAN and the whole tagline MAGENTA, losing the pink half of\nthe identity entirely.\n\nAdd BRAND_TEAL (xterm-256 73, #5FAFAF) and BRAND_PINK (xterm-256 169,\n#D75FAF) as new tokens in bin/lib/common.sh, measured from the logo asset\nand kept separate from MAGENTA/CYAN (already bound to print_status''s\ndebug/config levels, per blueprintx#253). Falls back to CYAN/MAGENTA on a\nterminal without 256-colour support, and NO_COLOR disables the tokens\nentirely.\n\nSplit each banner row and the tagline at the verified BLUEPRINT/X boundary\n(column 72, same index on every row).\n\nCloses #256\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XivhWbApyVDfvG6GGjo6xK\n\nCo-authored-by: ci-bot <ci-bot@example.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrc8jCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6BAQAGceZL4NED29DXRkxeW3rLwi\nz3vykU9QZlLUWNDimVut2drImYcMsq1mwIyMHaiPz8Rd1101qwUynGMAWlNt2xtC\n2b+zi1xYWFJzjVQWvZdkVZcYhcPd3FJeuKCnczcZy3P7kLVHsDQqAA47Q7TCMgAq\nUepjkSkS/X2VRJboZD3gxxtillks1eh9h+hPrjJMTWCwRy8lrW54iZt2kHklFFUf\n3mgoZK4+9bqnON9JdqASX2oZ9adbs3PxvR0UsDGdTaX4EDmhBMr/tA6DN2ajkFrA\nH5D/FEh0j++IUTI6XN64/5gspO