count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:45:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(settings): name what the celery helper actually does\n\nCopilot review on #309:\n\n- Rename restore_celery_task_routing -> ensure_celery_router_inputs. It\n  defaults the router''s *inputs* and falls back to celery''s own routing;\n  it does not restore upstream''s task -> queue table. Summary line and a\n  new second paragraph now say that outright.\n- apply_base_post_configure''s docstring names both members instead of\n  \"one... the other...\".\n- _apply_structural_overrides'' docstring listed only the JWT merge, but\n  apply_base_post_configure also defaults the celery router inputs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbf65766da1b1dc042a349459da348ff7c618644","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/cbf65766da1b1dc042a349459da348ff7c618644"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/e9b0e1047e3dc190c4299ede3285f875c81c8791","verification":{"payload":"tree cbf65766da1b1dc042a349459da348ff7c618644\nparent 647bdf75b2184d816b28cb09190bd0da157ed528\nauthor Nathan Levesque <nlevesq@mit.edu> 1791295090 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791297919 -0400\n\ndocs(settings): name what the celery helper actually does\n\nCopilot review on #309:\n\n- Rename restore_celery_task_routing -> ensure_celery_router_inputs. It\n  defaults the router''s *inputs* and falls back to celery''s own routing;\n  it does not restore upstream''s task -> queue table. Summary line and a\n  new second paragraph now say that outright.\n- apply_base_post_configure''s docstring names both members instead of\n  \"one... the other...\".\n- _apply_structural_overrides'' docstring listed only the JWT merge, but\n  apply_base_post_configure also defaults the celery router inputs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN 