":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/77571f5b8fb7bb43b40e4e4075759d8814990e5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:11:37Z","email":"tmacey@mit.edu","name":"Tobias Macey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:11:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mit-ol): bring the ulmo xpro cell plugin pins up to the master baseline (#268)\n\n#237 raised the ol-* plugin pins on the master and verawood cells to the\nversions published after mitodl/open-edx-plugins#845 and left release/ulmo\nuntouched. That left the xpro cell twelve plugins behind, and Renovate has\nsince opened twelve separate PRs (#255-#266) to close the gap one package at\na time, all editing the same block of this file.\n\nThe Django floor #845 introduced is not a constraint here: release/ulmo pins\ndjango==5.2.11, every one of these versions declares django>=5.2 and\nrequires_python >=3.11, and the cell''s release_python is 3.11. The\nmit-ol/ulmo/xpro compatibility cell is green on the individual Renovate PRs,\nwhich is the check that installs and imports each cell''s pins against its\nedx-platform branch.\n\nApplying all twelve in one commit runs that cell once instead of twelve\ntimes and avoids eleven rebases through the same lines. Renovate closes\n#255-#266 on its next run.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Uz85ddb9Eqd5E2GriQsju9\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d76e960f05119b749ddf52ee60f5168352be3404","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/d76e960f05119b749ddf52ee60f5168352be3404"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/77571f5b8fb7bb43b40e4e4075759d8814990e5e","verification":{"payload":"tree d76e960f05119b749ddf52ee60f5168352be3404\nparent f88692686b0cfbfa2834f8800aacb73f1b0d8498\nauthor Tobias Macey <tmacey@mit.edu> 1790611897 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790611897 -0400\n\nfix(mit-ol): bring the ulmo xpro cell plugin pins up to the master baseline (#268)\n\n#237 raised the ol-* plugin pins on the master and verawood cells to the\nversions published after mitodl/open-edx-plugins#845 and left release/ulmo\nuntouched. That left the xpro cell twelve plugins behind, and Renovate has\nsince opened twelve separate PRs (#255-#266) to close the gap one package at\na time, all editing the same block of this file.\n\nThe Django floor #845 introduced is not a constraint here: release/ulmo pins\ndjango==5.2.11, every one of these versions declares django>=5.2 and\nrequires_python >=3.11, and the cell''s release_python is 3.11. The\nmit-ol/ulmo/xpro compatibility cell is green on the individual Renovate PRs,\nwhich is the check that installs and imports each cell''s pins against its\nedx-platform branch.\n\nApplying all twelve in one commit runs that cell once instead of twelve\ntimes and avoids eleven rebases through the same lines. Renovate closes\n#255-#266 on its next run.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Uz85ddb9Eqd5E2GriQsju9\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqupG5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuxAQAC+AKv1OHYkJjKdTMYXto44L\nQ56sb1IG6XGb+tNZqp4MD07XSZIlw4TjI7maN200Hii8wjg3rxzdk51jqpGjOZtf\nqeMF4snSizFM98nGcfMD9Wu9EHcsQOibj9n4L6lMtK6kLNU/ZhqmPxYqsFntjqNz\nTpDKnC48B2W37abq+h8GWZTYn6tuhqeTqsXQMuAm0fUEm84ILRzuAcS6lCp94kzL\nE9GNjo8PCPLW2Y+P0zrHDwsczVOzvTI7dUbVJ3cz/3pQJShREIMok+MjJ0vkxafs\nYTVu2Yd/P7q98MtIiy4rK7SiR2ZWipX1PB7rr6DRh1PBMlJcTHbqSITsh0BRx7aG\njzhTPatJw8TmHZYfC6V6q+whT6VqeI8tfff7xTaG1qeJNh/fGjH1SiJPZvaLjHju\nV1nihDAdfYP/Wt1apmj6EiQWlk7gRGXtucXw5kVsPtypRDknj4Ulh+QoMwXYsjWp\niz9IBbOqYZ4prMPu504MGdBrju+r2T