 again.\n\nedx-platform master now pins 0.4.7, so the three master overrides added\nfor openedx/forum#289 are redundant too. The verawood overrides stay\nbecause release/verawood still pins 0.4.2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H1njWYcCQwpyG7YSDiq6Xo\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Tobias Macey <tmacey@boundlessnotions.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c3127aa3092b1b02641f8c81dbdf0fc8961e52d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/1c3127aa3092b1b02641f8c81dbdf0fc8961e52d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/cdb1b70b5527b27a51b677e59d344a7964e14992","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c3127aa3092b1b02641f8c81dbdf0fc8961e52d\nparent 17f8e80dc606e79b57bc3ac2f2715107850a212d\nauthor renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790611824 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790611824 -0400\n\nchore(deps): drop openedx-forum overrides that match upstream pins (#278)\n\n* chore(deps): update dependency openedx-forum to v0.4.7\n\n* chore(deps): Drop openedx-forum overrides that match upstream pins\n\nRenovate bumped the ulmo/xpro override to 0.4.7, which requires Python\n>=3.12 and cannot install on ulmo''s Python 3.11. edx-platform\nrelease/ulmo already pins 0.4.1, so the override was redundant and is\nremoved instead. That also stops Renovate from proposing the bump again.\n\nedx-platform master now pins 0.4.7, so the three master overrides added\nfor openedx/forum#289 are redundant too. The verawood overrides stay\nbecause release/verawood still pins 0.4.2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H1njWYcCQwpyG7YSDiq6Xo\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: 