it/cdb1b70b5527b27a51b677e59d344a7964e14992","node_id":"C_kwDORFoK8NoAKGNkYjFiNzBiNTUyN2IyN2E1MWI2NzdlNTlkMzQ0YTc5NjRlMTQ5OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mitodl/lehrer/commit/17f8e80dc606e79b57bc3ac2f2715107850a212d","sha":"17f8e80dc606e79b57bc3ac2f2715107850a212d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/17f8e80dc606e79b57bc3ac2f2715107850a212d"}],"sha":"cdb1b70b5527b27a51b677e59d344a7964e14992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/cdb1b70b5527b27a51b677e59d344a7964e14992"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/479088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blarghmatey","id":479088,"login":"blarghmatey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3OTA4OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/17f8e80dc606e79b57bc3ac2f2715107850a212d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:10:08Z","email":"tmacey@mit.edu","name":"Tobias Macey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:10:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(upstream): drop pinned and retired repos from the mit-ol watch list (#283)\n\nThe watch list still reported instructor-dashboard as exposed after\nol-infrastructure #5697 dropped its legacy rows, and after #6058 pinned\nthe admin-console, gradebook and learner-dashboard master rows to\nlegacy-mfe it reported all three as breaking builds that no longer\ntrack master. `--fail-on-landing` stayed red on exposure that no longer\nexists.\n\nThis brings the list in line with version_matrix.py @ 2e9f9e609 by\ndropping all four. The file already treats a pinned deployment as\ninsulated and unlisted, and a LANDED repo never changes state again, so\nkeeping them would only hold the landing issue open with rows nobody\nhas to act on. Their remaining cutover work is absorbing each module\ninto a Site Project.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FP7D3ULwwxXhgN8hFfb8DF\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6561ef2dc2a1203e4bb7bfcc2792f72c81fccb36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/6561ef2dc2a1203e4bb7bfcc2792f72c81fccb36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/17f8e80dc606e79b57bc3ac2f2715107850a212d","verification":{"payload":"tree 6561ef2dc2a1203e4bb7bfcc2792f72c81fccb36\nparent 4e0aec082529d504d037d8653b5a4063a990c5c1\nauthor Tobias Macey <tmacey@mit.edu> 1790611808 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790611808 -0400\n\nfix(upstream): drop pinned and retired repos from the mit-ol watch list (#283)\n\nThe watch list still reported instructor-dashboard as exposed after\nol-infrastructure #5697 dropped its legacy rows, and after #6058 pinned\nthe admin-console, gradebook and learner-dashboard master rows to\nlegacy-mfe it reported all three as breaking builds that no longer\ntrack master. `--fail-on-landing` stayed red on exposure that no longer\nexists.\n\nThis brings the list in line with version_matrix.py @ 2e9f9e609 by\ndropping all four. The file already treats a pinned deployment as\ninsulated and unlisted, and a LANDED repo never changes state again, so\nkeeping them would only hold the landing issue open with rows nobody\nhas to act on. Their remaining cutover work is absorbing each module\ninto a Site Project.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FP7D3ULwwxXhgN8hFfb8DF\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqupFgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAONMQAAGAJY0NOlvecTchAf3ufdTT\nc7Lkx4t9Hr3nMa/xGkxcADvM26j+1wUsHH97fXc9EYn9IR0decS3y8RqW4XRFHgO\njAExijB5WtvXuJLjpuFhYCwfAG7Xveq0dGqMyxTI1O9n5W+fy7R8JGI2NqSW1uEH\nnatiZsvRqvaBbf0AGj+9EC3sB20cYkpt5ir8JPY1rfR6EVI2L+tqVairAbiGeYuJ\nRWuDy+3bMWpMxT4re84v2H/kD13soDvweNA14ezvtpW3dEdaezH/8EAtnFjxIMU8\nO8mitSPNH9RSlcGcfKpa52vCon3KH19CiDPFOmiGULFh1lu0H8XYCGKqSYsVg2wk\nuRp+JqWPYfAD9HLxxbW8//0DaOLMnLHgQByWwKRPAH1LH3WBqvonWQOI1hZI2ocr\nz7hwioK7RyloFx26Ber/3kg6OpV9+V1cn6T5wrWzzU5vzH4x5WvQipRMdHmZ9e8i\nsqz6M9pziwA7spnwPYvYRYGJhQiapGIFitWHfwKxRLgORl7ckUGZ+ssqaoHAPTFz\nJ6u4LOhU2Z4su3b/ig/oZZneYEfpqxG9qkdVveRtNJF9XOmhH/hlUejntzj8S38u\npEwQaRt5O8oNqdjv7UewDTmLhY7uiXGfRNWdhbs3JGgAwGx1R3mYgpa9VSRB3mjb\nL0uGn8gkufGKL4VjC+oy\n=Q8UL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T16:10:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mitodl/lehrer/commit/17f8e80dc606e79b57bc3ac2f2715107850a212d","node_id":"C_kwDORFoK8NoAKDE3ZjhlODBkYzYwNmU3OWI1N2JjM2FjMmYyNzE1MTA3ODUwYTIxMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mitodl/lehrer/commit/4e0aec082529d504d037d8653b5a4063a990c5c1","sha":"4e0aec082529d504d037d8653b5a4063a990c5c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/4e0aec082529d504d037d8653b5a4063a990c5c1"}],"sha":"17f8e80dc606e79b57bc3ac2f2715107850a212d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/17f8e80dc606e79b57bc3ac2f2715107850a212d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/479088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blarghmatey","id":479088,"login":"blarghmatey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3OTA4OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/4e0aec082529d504d037d8653b5a4063a990c5c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:37:11Z","email":"tmacey@mit.edu","name":"Tobias Macey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:37:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(local-dev): prune superseded build images from host Docker (#273)\n\n* fix(local-dev): prune superseded build images from host Docker\n\nEach custom_build loads or builds its image into host Docker under a fresh\ntilt-build-* tag and pushes it, and skips_local_docker keeps Tilt''s\ndocker_prune from ever considering those tags. At ~6GB per platform\nimage, one working session pushed the disk under k3s''s eviction threshold\nand LMS, CMS and the workers were evicted.\n\nAfter a successful push, each build now removes its own repo''s older\ntilt-build-* tags and keeps the newest. The pods pull from lehrer-registry,\nso the host copies are not needed. A failed prune warns instead of failing\na build whose push succeeded. `lehrer dev teardown` also removes the\nremaining tilt-build-* images, since the registry they were pushed to is\ndeleted with the cluster.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R4rGdzeWXPyo5PEKrqpvwa\n\n* fix(local-dev): warn when listing images for the prune fails\n\nsh has no pipefail, so with `docker images` at the head of the pipeline a\nfailure there left xargs exiting 0 and skipped the prune without the\nwarning. Capturing the listing first puts its exit status in the chain,\nand replaces xargs -r, a GNU extension. The tests now run the rendered\ncommand against a stub docker instead of counting strings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R4rGdzeWXPyo5PEKrqpvwa\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55f13044c23ab1d51dd2fcea1fee736d219465fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/55f13044c23ab1d51dd2fcea1fee736d219465fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/4e0aec082529d504d037d8653b5a4063a990c5c1","verification":{"payload":"tree 55f13044c23ab1d51dd2fcea1fee736d219465fb\nparent 1fb3d9bb3f927e2c749e4b5269c45980db45703a\nauthor Tobias Macey <tmacey@mit.edu> 1790530631 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790530631 -0400\n\nfix(local-dev): prune superseded build images from host Docker (#273)\n\n* fix(local-dev): prune superseded build images from host Docker\n\nEach custom_build loads or builds its image into host Docker under a fresh\ntilt-build-* tag and pushes it, and skips_local_docker keeps Tilt''s\ndocker_prune from ever considering those tags. At ~6GB per platform\nimage, one working session pushed the disk under k3s''s eviction threshold\nand LMS, CMS and the workers were evicted.\n\nAfter a successful push, each build now removes its own repo''s older\ntilt-build-* tags and keeps the newest. The pods pull from lehrer-registry,\nso the host copies are not needed. A failed prune warns instead of failing\na build whose push succeeded. `lehrer dev teardown` also removes the\nremaining tilt-build-* images, since the registry they were pushed to is\ndeleted with the cluster.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R4rGdzeWXPyo5PEKrqpvwa\n\n* fix(local-dev): warn when listing images for the prune fails\n\nsh has no pipefail, so with `docker images` at the head of the pipeline a\nfailure there left xargs exiting 0 and skipped the prune without the\nwarning. Capturing the listing first puts its exit status in the chain,\nand replaces xargs -r, a GNU extension. The tests now run the rendered\ncommand against a stub docker instead of counting strings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R4rGdzeWXPyo5PEKrqpvwa\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquVRHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT1sQAJWrKK83CZQQbGS5BHQh62TX\nPyqj8XLNuI6SogbTgnRE6gBkQAeLgBNlxKH5QadiGtwOsqqxfk5T+Bs8iKc3SD/E\nGXliq8V8PyYn1zSFIhxyoMu16cTTk2zWX7aH+q13nP+prAE3lwoNxPIYlcP75Fp5\n