https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blarghmatey","id":479088,"login":"blarghmatey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3OTA4OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/2a44ad2ae2bbadcb6fcc556eb072fc163ab3bd98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:26:45Z","email":"tmacey@mit.edu","name":"Tobias Macey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:26:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(local-dev): reference images by bare name so setup() callers pick the registry (#270)\n\n* fix(local-dev): reference images by bare name so setup() callers pick the registry\n\nThe platform, codejail and notes manifests hardcoded\nlehrer-registry:5000/<image>:dev, which only matched the build refs when the\ncaller passed registry_k8s=\"lehrer-registry:5000\". Any other caller (e.g.\nol-infrastructure''s local-dev openedx Tiltfile) had its builds skipped as\nunused and its pods pulling the literal ref.\n\nThis builds and references every image by bare name and lets Tilt supply the\nregistry, from k3d''s local-registry-hosting ConfigMap or from\ndefault_registry. The sed that stripped the escaped \"lehrer-registry_5000_\"\ninfix is gone because a bare name is never escaped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015r4tZXHUdY9qKsu62QH5Wb\n\n* refactor(local-dev): let default_registry split push and pull hosts\n\ndefault_registry(registry_k8s) made $EXPECTED_REF the in-cluster address, so\nevery custom_build sed-rewrote it to the host-side one before pushing, and the\nrewrite only matched when the ref started with registry_k8s exactly.\ndefault_registry(registry, host_from_cluster=registry_k8s) gives Tilt both\naddresses: $EXPECTED_REF is the host-side ref and pods get the in-cluster\none, the same split k3d''s local-registry-hosting ConfigMap already provides.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015r4tZXHUdY9qKsu62QH5Wb\n\n* doc(local-dev): update stale registry comment on the LMS image\n\nIt still said lehrer-core.star derives the registry prefix from\nLEHRER_REGISTRY_K8S, which nothing reads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015r4tZXHUdY9qKsu62QH5Wb\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3a3579b1ea8d3264b25d80d7b6183c56643dca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/a3a3579b1ea8d3264b25d80d7b6183c56643dca5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/2a44ad2ae2bbadcb6fcc556eb072fc163ab3bd98","verification":{"payload":"tree a3a3579b1ea8d3264b25d80d7b6183c56643dca5\nparent e73cc5daf2b0394ec53a09d317f36717576f5c73\nauthor Tobias Macey <tmacey@mit.edu> 1790371605 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790371605 -0400\n\nfix(local-dev): reference images by bare name so setup() callers pick the registry (#270)\n\n* fix(local-dev): reference images by bare name so setup() callers pick the registry\n\nThe platform, codejail and notes manifests hardcoded\nlehrer-registry:5000/<image>:dev, which only matched the build refs when the\ncaller passed registry_k8s=\"lehrer-registry:5000\". Any other caller (e.g.\nol-infrastructure''s local-dev openedx Tiltfile) had its builds skipped as\nunused and its pods pulling the literal ref.\n\nThis builds and references every image by bare name and lets Tilt supply the\nregistry, from k3d''s local-registry-hosting ConfigMap or from\ndefault_registry. The sed that stripped the escaped \"lehrer-registry_5000_\"\ninfix is gone because a bare name is never escaped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015r4tZXHUdY9qKsu62QH5Wb\n\n* refactor(local-dev): let default_registry split push and pull hosts\n\ndefault_registry(registry_k8s) made $EXPECTED_REF the in-cluster address, so\nevery custom_build sed-rewrote it to the host-side one before pushing, and the\nrewrite only matched when the ref started with registry_k8s exactly.\ndefault_registry(registry, host_from_cluster=registry_k8s) gives Tilt both\naddresses: $EXPECTED_REF is the host-side ref and pods get the in-cluster\none, the same split k3d''s local-registry-hosting ConfigMap already provides.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015r4tZXHUdY9qKsu62QH5Wb\n\n* doc(local-dev): update stale registry comment on the LMS image\n\nIt still said lehrer-core.star derives the registry prefix from\nLEHRER_REGISTRY_K8S, which nothing reads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015r4tZXHUdY9qKsu62QH5Wb\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtucVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXIsQAJmTMBxKw6x6QQ0rtyY7I5wa\nwsEPXKhvNdGryGkBlh6jZuXShUlsjhQ9vkbrjZRvvzNo56PWgw33yxdWw1n0y8nA\noGiKNQxOTUDHq7WggbQRvMDfpo+GSxdocqqU1UBUkC95UsicdIzAv29mzb31lsfc\nXlWCMJD+2jsmmn7/7xfbM+BVsHAQIQWvdgruzQEehvZphreRgObquWSkyMFd7aMg\nIspZ/pbTuBZSR392oPPrgSKJ/cWRqVECdnET1e1oqFQoBo9vv0mwBQulG+rxYNxA\n9ZUlhposxFFUUdlVnhlXRrdSqCGLRHCSUyvRxAPFR0JJvo75Xmx+gaf4dSzumiEy\n16Il7ZJQpjU/A4zKy4zMeVfMVNiyKLMbu