aster LMS settings models (#231)\n\n* fix(mit-ol): regenerate master LMS settings model for upstream middleware removal\n\nedx-platform master dropped CodeOwnerMonitoringMiddleware from MIDDLEWARE,\nso the committed model no longer matches a fresh render and settings-verify\nfails for every master cell, including main''s scheduled run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J43t1WXNsmVV5mbdzxv6iT\n\n* fix(generic): drop CodeOwnerMonitoringMiddleware from the master LMS settings model\n\nSame upstream removal as the mit-ol model. main''s scheduled settings-verify\nreported the identical one-line drift for generic/master/generic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J43t1WXNsmVV5mbdzxv6iT\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe8ab21bb1c49bfdea0788953aaf479c3344b1fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/fe8ab21bb1c49bfdea0788953aaf479c3344b1fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/214a5fc01ba7557bb6cdd5cab41f36a41ced72d5","verification":{"payload":"tree fe8ab21bb1c49bfdea0788953aaf479c3344b1fd\nparent c7ac486a59fb22061e7bbc2a55ebed0b6df8a1c9\nauthor Tobias Macey <tmacey@mit.edu> 1789400959 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789400959 -0400\n\nfix: drop CodeOwnerMonitoringMiddleware from the master LMS settings models (#231)\n\n* fix(mit-ol): regenerate master LMS settings model for upstream middleware removal\n\nedx-platform master dropped CodeOwnerMonitoringMiddleware from MIDDLEWARE,\nso the committed model no longer matches a fresh render and settings-verify\nfails for every master cell, including main''s scheduled run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J43t1WXNsmVV5mbdzxv6iT\n\n* fix(generic): drop CodeOwnerMonitoringMiddleware from the master LMS settings model\n\nSame upstream removal as the mit-ol model. main''s scheduled settings-verify\nreported the identical one-line drift for generic/master/generic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J43t1WXNsmVV5mbdzxv6iT\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqBd/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/JwQAJehjjPUQiMhVzevKH5LPO4K\nZbDAgh2HKucmIaikJJg0fzAMnntrG5RvFfql/ZFm5lMtYnf9WRxTUSN2C7i3rT0V\n4dLkaCfHIRyPgZplOiyHJF9I8p3Cyh0Zq/QvgRi0sx7+DVICPCBhTF9GVdC3+8Vg\n0NiWwhQvBBK4J7lJ5gzYHsMfWY22O7A2enbYgOHzc9lmXjYvKufmxLP3h1bVxkz8\nxCf3F2jeUa3BgStzRZe5A2m6XiUSBD3EiIdPWwaVf1cq5GgfdHC3s0A700r9JRaQ\nJ7eWyebdDjkS+E0gomE2fyUPdKHr2XcQ/vETWsAMH2fE3Ov8saoBD7NSx3Y1RF4f\nrEl/Yoykku0vLERxyQsrWsuhilSPxl9AlD9evnruAoBcrAB3W2boxpkbvow/ATVq\nZqPzetEjvylTj0vyfbQiol0WjRf2/NodORMsvtI+HyAauvIYx/0b9i9fOVy0Nb/z\n/R7LnQjQN7Jvsp4qnceoCx6DR9SUfBD9I6l9xX0StuhJXub64GAn8gF0S7k0SFM6\nva6jFU3ilhDFzk6eGMVBqTnEAvjXRId3IXQISLrNFo249L4Pk8N1IOjnFB338zT9\nfAwP/ffnbjz8/yCKY8yudDMgAkKJSISJH97T3EkgvCpWcxD/8Qc0dS5D+WE+Ik4i\nKp66AOEGw/iNKHdFsU3E\n=lIrz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T15:49:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.g