"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:36:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mfe): pin webpack to 5.110.3 to unblock legacy MFE build (#230)\n\nwebpack 5.111.0 rewrote HTML embedded-source minification so the\nminimizer plugin''s Terser rejecting the forwarded `as` option is now a\nhard error instead of a warning, failing index.html. The build''s\nunpinned `npm install webpack` started pulling 5.111.0 after it was\npublished. 5.110.3 is the last version that built cleanly.","tree":{"sha":"f1197d2ad17f1bd31e3d8771fdcb6b31762d9e4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/f1197d2ad17f1bd31e3d8771fdcb6b31762d9e4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/c7ac486a59fb22061e7bbc2a55ebed0b6df8a1c9","verification":{"payload":"tree f1197d2ad17f1bd31e3d8771fdcb6b31762d9e4c\nparent b83fd9c5c6ae9a412d91873cd7f61c25b7091235\nauthor Zaman Afzal <zamanafzal@gmail.com> 1789396606 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789396606 -0400\n\nfix(mfe): pin webpack to 5.110.3 to unblock legacy MFE build (#230)\n\nwebpack 5.111.0 rewrote HTML embedded-source minification so the\nminimizer plugin''s Terser rejecting the forwarded `as` option is now a\nhard error instead of a warning, failing index.html. The build''s\nunpinned `npm install webpack` started pulling 5.111.0 after it was\npublished. 5.110.3 is the last version that built cleanly.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqAZ+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbgwQAJ3ujz6nyM3R1Igq3FnMX+5y\nEzAlqWwno4wOp4DMSR2fTW9A8FPb0AaiZ2teQ3sDnKL0e+Lv9HDpjLo9Lzpypnlv\nTkdLK9I82BMmcvWFiuD6THcoU99nmz9osji0GwpTO3xC3Uqcpj7ZZOfmCMe3zE4n\nWVIriYte25AdYuTgrJ7gLx4cg9XQACT7w7kGxR87ChJvnLdpYNOoWD8BsIvZ1Q64\nBXvUD4iu/d2/RDBjjrVP+INKu9Hy7PUQplTC85ohJcF3wXFOezV2Bcl1fZnepleR\nWf9AUfs1h2KBgYexLlMKGGEO2R3ZA4h66+tFAcUsN5jzBdVobVxfbS9VznOrtlOg\nrfoWByOLFJw5DDRACdyJ5P+qdShp3D/gGYTqGC0Kihm0YsA1dJuoc8bc+UKb0RH/\nTTd4rPCP7QGffl+/Rl4zvMMQ9MzqAzfOoRbxU/O13cPbUSA/N+roNp813i