thub.com/users/Anas12091101/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anas12091101","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/08c5f1151fa173769d4212ceb65d326d25933e63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:19:02Z","email":"88967643+Anas12091101@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Muhammad Anas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:19:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mitxonline): hide the certificate status card on the progress tab (#223)\n\nMITx Online issues its own certificates, so edX has none to deliver and the\nlearning MFE must not promise one. Hides the default contents of both progress\ntab certificate status slots.\n\nBoth are needed: the MFE renders the card through the main body slot below\nParagon''s `large` breakpoint (992px) and the side panel slot at or above it, so\nhiding one leaves it visible at the other width. The inner\nprogress_certificate_status slot is not used here -- it sits inside the Card, so\nhiding it would leave an empty card behind.\n\nMatches the legacy progress page change in mitodl/mitxonline-theme#90.\n\nRefs mitxonline-issues#1474\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a32d2c3b0d614af52e5396c0a4e991c456885840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/a32d2c3b0d614af52e5396c0a4e991c456885840"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/08c5f1151fa173769d4212ceb65d326d25933e63","verification":{"payload":"tree a32d2c3b0d614af52e5396c0a4e991c456885840\nparent fe2dbf95c8760f6c9f9f8bf66382fc6d78313fdc\nauthor Muhammad Anas <88967643+Anas12091101@users.noreply.github.com> 1788862742 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788862742 +0500\n\nfix(mitxonline): hide the certificate status card on the progress tab (#223)\n\nMITx Online issues its own certificates, so edX has none to deliver and the\nlearning MFE must not promise one. Hides the default contents of both progress\ntab certificate status slots.\n\nBoth are needed: the MFE renders the card through the main body slot below\nParagon''s `large` breakpoint (992px) and the side panel slot at or above it, so\nhiding one leaves it visible at the other width. The inner\nprogress_certificate_status slot is not used here -- it sits inside the Card, so\nhiding it would leave an empty card behind.\n\nMatches the legacy progress page change in mitodl/mitxonline-theme#90.\n\nRefs mitxonline-issues#1474\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn+EWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANaoQALEyhPnnM6e2aXA9LzmP+MuU\n70IrLw9iZ8/GQ7mljqNVMnlGB7b95Pdkf9bOe/gNYDmcZZnQAVv4bJivQxMoXPNF\nldweYEpM3UliX9m9qEP8t9mtGql3wkUVwhLyu5Bh4u4trjiIWhY3nBp+xoe0Vw2x\nKklDHIMMSkmyrXdK6omLbSroWpZ0ixttF6CBodvhrGDpJDfHXhCyCv9jr+KTWgh/\n3MLP4cofU0Jxhrdn84egwT+HLEeR2DQPzNuYySTp+G5o26DvZf4HMGzgz1iQaNrt\nAMIYjgQKNCmbhES84bJd6LvP1A4u3hqL3glEoNGw8ze7yzU4Ezu06md5dMVLxFEo\nQo113LyiyRNMIOV40a4Jzg77IlTskpDT75h+atNlWsqBxT+L6amaichrtiSvChzf\nxK40/oK8I1VKU7BEvoJGAk0JWNb/8+BS/Z6w00/GtbbBxo1et5cM7I6kBSR+ovbl\nIBdgGcOBfDVDc5E0u9uvpe9MKgdLSUe9k+ZA/xJNGN062fsVN0TvhLavLZhtSdfb\ndu8RNTlSlBDjmERY5smSiTWYiv7xaOt5brjl2D0EOkMLQN4KUlDLrc/tnHNu5m34\nHh5L1cYPeuGqh4Pz5hR8aTSYlZLYS6BKKdVA6ezFCAZZLhAIetI4GWbrd13SR7jK\nrXQQ3qb/Vcyfg/PlgX4t\n=bIQ7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T10:19:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0