/blarghmatey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blarghmatey","id":479088,"login":"blarghmatey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3OTA4OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/commits/b4e52423c66eff013352dc974b707cd266ffaee7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T21:10:08Z","email":"tmacey@mit.edu","name":"Tobias Macey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T21:10:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(settings): regenerate mit-ol/master aqueduct LMS model, drop ENABLE_MFE_CONFIG_API (#200)\n\nUpstream edx-platform master dropped this toggle from lms.envs.common;\nthe committed aqueduct.py model still declared it, which fails settings\ndrift verification for the master-release cells (mitxonline, mitx,\nmitx-staging). CI on #198 surfaced the pre-existing drift because that\nPR touches build_manifest.yaml, which triggers settings verification\nfor all mit-ol cells.\n\nRegenerated via:\n  dagger call platform regenerate-aqueduct-settings \\\n    --deployment-name mitxonline --release-name master \\\n    --build-manifest deployments/mit-ol/build_manifest.yaml \\\n    export --path ./generated\n\nVerified drift-free for mitxonline, mitx, and mitx-staging with\n`dagger call platform verify-settings --drift=true`.","tree":{"sha":"612b51896364e991e92e1a5d8fceae2e2e002d3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/trees/612b51896364e991e92e1a5d8fceae2e2e002d3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitodl/lehrer/git/commits/b4e52423c66eff013352dc974b707cd266ffaee7","verification":{"payload":"tree 612b51896364e991e92e1a5d8fceae2e2e002d3d\nparent 8d3781957473923178393817b557eb1a167ba9c6\nauthor Tobias Macey <tmacey@mit.edu> 1787951408 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787951408 -0400\n\nfix(settings): regenerate mit-ol/master aqueduct LMS model, drop ENABLE_MFE_CONFIG_API (#200)\n\nUpstream edx-platform master dropped this toggle from lms.envs.common;\nthe committed aqueduct.py model still declared it, which fails settings\ndrift verification for the master-release cells (mitxonline, mitx,\nmitx-staging). CI on #198 surfaced the pre-existing drift because that\nPR touches build_manifest.yaml, which triggers settings verification\nfor all mit-ol cells.\n\nRegenerated via:\n  dagger call platform regenerate-aqueduct-settings \\\n    --deployment-name mitxonline --release-name master \\\n    --build-manifest deployments/mit-ol/build_manifest.yaml \\\n    export --path ./generated\n\nVerified drift-free for mitxonline, mitx, and mitx-staging with\n`dagger call platform verify-settings --drift=true`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkfkwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJb8QAAiUNMW6FhtuLNTJ1sIF2cBs\nrVJT0oTh0ZR5kSfSiERCAK7+CnPpv+9dCKPznm2V8w3xTXMhk4o9l1rfawHlfZaQ\nbEF15re+BBVHopwt73HeARaEdzKbFZY2AOvjKQTP2NZs5zKWmO6FapNSAo3/30IK\nesTa5RvzBI7ikVnxN5vxbLGYP3Ndd+OU3EaJV4WkGKrYL31l1HujdzG/rb6yqZPy\n9YVRE/i4LsxkYj+ddJ8x8wHqAT1kZHZ1wS6H6iKkid2aeFbSL4LJJ6tVAj8/OBCV\n6o6i5THuMmdM8BnKIIPN5TIjgR7DEVMmafRaScND40d3Gnf03+Z3TgKch44m3IbK\nO+T3BayLIFJ+cDfmz3A2wmaruc2JNXzMWmBuPYoBEF3Z8VzV5VvAa9NLwHrd/Frf\nzmBcSQsceUaXeJxuBTOdSmOm0Z/cWdFRdAhgHzAUwxiYIBw3tLvv0mPse3uOcjFP\npW7mIzP8mEC0UZErXUpDGnRTzi8RNirde53Fz9d+ijACqjwoo+/aFWAtCmanxABf\nLBxj8pALo9+Snf2J/9OgPfwt+r3HltSbs39VdkOODDSqxpYWCmXZ2NN/xDxFtECm\nCE3ycZwg1n