ses them first with\nJudgeIdRequiredException / JudgeNameRequiredException (412, translated message), blank values\nincluded. A missing country is stored as '''', the column''s own default, rather than an explicit\nNULL that broke the same way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"932a160e9377802f217bb244ce08d0c4587c0c4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/932a160e9377802f217bb244ce08d0c4587c0c4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/57d117bd02791df3ede7550d520da6c7f1e23f65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/57d117bd02791df3ede7550d520da6c7f1e23f65","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDU3ZDExN2JkMDI3OTFkZjNlZGU3NTUwZDUyMGRhNmM3ZjFlMjNmNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/171c5addd71685f3b846899fcac90b11c828567e","sha":"171c5addd71685f3b846899fcac90b11c828567e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/171c5addd71685f3b846899fcac90b11c828567e"}],"sha":"57d117bd02791df3ede7550d520da6c7f1e23f65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/57d117bd02791df3ede7550d520da6c7f1e23f65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/171c5addd71685f3b846899fcac90b11c828567e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:07:15Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:07:15Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Staging and production run a GraalVM native image, with New Relic fed over OTLP\n\nThe Dockerfile now builds the loader with nativeCompile and ships only the executable. On the\n512MB boxes it is ready in under a second on Fly (19s before) and 7s on Render''s 0.1 CPU (102s),\nand uses about 130MB after load instead of 370MB.\n\nA native image cannot load the New Relic Java agent, so production sends metrics, traces and\nlogs over OTLP to New Relic instead (OTLP_EXPORT_ENABLED in fly.toml, NEW_RELIC_LICENSE_KEY as a\nFly secret). Staging exports nothing. newrelic.yml, which carried the license key, leaves the repo.\n\nSpring''s AOT processing freezes the active profiles and every @ConditionalOn check at build time,\nso it runs as `deployed` with export forced on, and OpenTelemetryExportConfiguration switches\ntraces and logs at runtime. What the image cannot discover by itself is declared in\nNativeImageHintsConfiguration: the OAS DTOs (list responses came out as empty objects), jOOQ\nrecords and array types, Caffeine''s generated classes, Google''s token types and the resources read\nby path. Flyway''s scanner cannot list the image''s resources, so NativeImageMigrationsProvider lists\nthe migrations, and the use case transaction advisor now looks the transaction manager up lazily\nso AOT does not need a DataSource.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80da65362b5efc7b46249fe1d089632199553a35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/80da65362b5efc7b46249fe1d089632199553a35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/171c5addd71685f3b846899fcac90b11c828567e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/171c5addd71685f3b846899fcac90b11c828567e","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDE3MWM1YWRkZDcxNjg1ZjNiODQ2ODk5ZmNhYzkwYjExYzgyODU2N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/1b9f3c642d249454f91e4bf4a3bfc1a16104f244","sha":"1b9f3c642d249454f91e4bf4a3bfc1a16104f244","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1b9f3c642d249454f91e4bf4a3bfc1a16104f244"}],"sha":"171c5addd71685f3b846899fcac90b11c828567e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/171c5addd71685f3b846899fcac90b11c828567e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1b9f3c642d249454f91e4bf4a3bfc1a16104f244/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T08:00:07Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T08:00:07Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"The dog index cron degrades an inactive dog in the same run that records its events\n\nWhen a run appended event records it stopped there and skipped the degradation check, so\na rebuild over an empty history (or an old event imported late) left every inactive dog\non the index it had right after its last event until the next run, 15 days later. After\nthe 2026-09-24 rebuild the public ranking showed dogs retired for two years in the top 1%.\nThe events just appended now count as the latest record, and the degradation as of today\nis appended right after them when the last event is already past the freshness plateau.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf26a7785387838b0ddaf906937678893ce1a1bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/bf26a7785387838b0ddaf906937678893ce1a1bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/1b9f3c642d249454f91e4bf4a3bfc1a16104f244","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/1b9f3c642d249454f91e4bf4a3bfc1a16104f244","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDFiOWYzYzY0MmQyNDk0NTRmOTFlNGJmNGEzYmZjMWExNjEwNGYyNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/3ba3ad19c62a213639d5ae30a4d958184fd9d0db","sha":"3ba3ad19c62a213639d5ae30a4d958184fd9d0db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3ba3ad19c62a213639d5ae30a4d958184fd9d0db"}],"sha":"1b9f3c642d249454f91e4bf4a3bfc1a16104f244","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1b9f3c642d249454f91e4bf4a3bfc1a16104f244"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3ba3ad19c62a213639d5ae30a4d958184fd9d0db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:22:12Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:22:12Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"The OAS stubs no longer ship springdoc, so the backend stops excluding it\n\nArchetype 1.1.0 generates the stubs with springdoc provided, and the regenerated\noas-definition-stubs 0.0.1-SNAPSHOT only brings spring-boot-starter-web,\njackson-databind-nullable and jakarta.validation-api at runtime. The exclude is gone; Swagger UI\nstill comes from the loader''s developmentOnly in local runs, and spring-boot-starter-validation\nstays declared for the stubs'' @Valid / @NotNull. Built and tested against the published stubs:\njar 45.8 MB, no springdoc inside, Hibernate Validator kept.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a46a930af6db31f2d33b73b566afc365bd03ea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/4a46a930af6db31f2d33b73b566afc365bd03ea7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/3ba3ad19c62a213639d5ae30a4d958184fd9d0db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/3ba3ad19c62a213639d5ae30a4d958184fd9d0db","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDNiYTNhZDE5YzYyYTIxMzYzOWQ1YWUzMGE0ZDk1ODE4NGZkOWQwZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/bfa981004b16963220e19c2c95c7733797a8355b","sha":"bfa981004b16963220e19c2c95c7733797a8355b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/bfa981004b16963220e19c2c95c7733797a8355b"}],"sha":"3ba3ad19c62a213639d5ae30a4d958184fd9d0db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3ba3ad19c62a213639d5ae30a4d958184fd9d0db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/bfa981004b16963220e19c2c95c7733797a8355b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:14:50Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:15:10Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"The dog index history cron works in blocks of dogs, each committed on its own\n\nThe first run over an empty history rebuilds every dog''s timeline, and it read all 7.5k\nsnap_dog_rank rows, built every record and inserted them in one batch inside one transaction:\ntens of MB of heap on a box with ~40 MB to spare, and the run that answered 502 in production.\nIt now pages the dogs by keyset (200 per block, k9x-backend.crons.dog-rank.block-size) and each\nblock reads only its dogs'' results and latest records, then appends and commits them. The ranking\nsnapshot is rewritten once, after the last block, in its own transaction.\n\nLike the snapshot cron, the use case is no longer a TransactionalUseCase: its two write adapters\nopen their own transaction. A run that dies half-way is resumed by the next one, since each dog\nonly appends what is newer than its latest record, and the ranking stays as the last run left it.\n\nReplayed locally on production''s volume (7,535 results of 2,375 dogs) in a 459 MB container:\nthe same 7,534 records, 12 blocks, peak 245 MiB instead of 258 MiB, heap 78/121 MB at the end.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c88a35195423772dd3839fabf492a3ba1c6bf8ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/c88a35195423772dd3839fabf492a3ba1c6bf8ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/bfa981004b16963220e19c2c95c7733797a8355b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/bfa981004b16963220e19c2c95c7733797a8355b","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKGJmYTk4MTAwNGIxNjk2MzIyMGUxOWMyYzk1Yzc3MzM3OTdhODM1NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/40fbb3b2d3526cd826f4991f0fed3cd931908452","sha":"40fbb3b2d3526cd826f4991f0fed3cd931908452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/40fbb3b2d3526cd826f4991f0fed3cd931908452"}],"sha":"bfa981004b16963220e19c2c95c7733797a8355b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/bfa981004b16963220e19c2c95c7733797a8355b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/40fbb3b2d3526cd826f4991f0fed3cd931908452/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:06:49Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:06:49Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Swagger stays in local runs and out of the deployed jar\n\nThe OAS stubs publish springdoc as a runtime dependency, so springdoc, Swagger UI, swagger-core\nand a few Jackson 2 modules were in the jar and ~1,500 of their classes loaded at every start of\nthe 512 MB box, while the deployed profile had the docs switched off anyway. springdoc is now\nexcluded from the stubs and declared developmentOnly in the loader: bootRun and the IDE keep\nSwagger UI with both groups and the JWT Authorize button, the bootJar does not carry it.\nOpenApiConfiguration compiles against springdoc as compileOnly and is skipped by\n@ConditionalOnClass where it is absent.\n\nBean Validation used to arrive through springdoc; spring-boot-starter-validation is now\ndeclared, so the stubs'' @Valid / @NotNull are enforced as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aab755b074230a884c28f808f038d5d00d05fc05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/aab755b074230a884c28f808f038d5d00d05fc05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/40fbb3b2d3526cd826f4991f0fed3cd931908452","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/40fbb3b2d3526cd826f4991f0fed3cd931908452","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDQwZmJiM2IyZDM1MjZjZDgyNmY0OTkxZjBmZWQzY2Q5MzE5MDg0NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/ae5d912d36ba13461b022c5ddc56019db96a703a","sha":"ae5d912d36ba13461b022c5ddc56019db96a703a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/ae5d912d36ba13461b022c5ddc56019db96a703a"}],"sha":"40fbb3b2d3526cd826f4991f0fed3cd931908452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/40fbb3b2d3526cd826f4991f0fed3cd931908452"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/ae5d912d36ba13461b022c5ddc56019db96a703a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:01:36Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:01:36Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Web push is sent with the JDK''s own crypto instead of web-push and BouncyCastle\n\nThe web-push library pulled BouncyCastle, Netty, async-http-client, Apache httpasyncclient and\njcommander into the 512 MB box: 13 MB of the jar, for what the JDK already does. The adapter now\nbuilds the message itself: Vapid signs the RFC 8292 token with SHA256withECDSAinP1363Format,\nWebPushEncryption encrypts the payload per RFC 8291 in the aes128gcm coding (ECDH on P-256,\nHKDF-SHA256, AES-128-GCM), and java.net.http.HttpClient posts it with the same headers and\n28-day TTL as before. Status mapping is unchanged.\n\nThe encryption reproduces the RFC 8291 test vector byte for byte; the adapter is tested against\na local HTTP server that decrypts what it receives. The adapter now refuses at startup a VAPID\npublic key that does not match the private one, which every push service would reject with 403.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a0338d47bb4a88c053ed9b7df06940ee1eff64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/7a0338d47bb4a88c053ed9b7df06940ee1eff64e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/ae5d912d36ba13461b022c5ddc56019db96a703a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/ae5d912d36ba13461b022c5ddc56019db96a703a","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKGFlNWQ5MTJkMzZiYTEzNDYxYjAyMmM1ZGRjNTYwMTlkYjk2YTcwM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/16246a1f72e77f1e821e7cc9084a4a7a09577b38","sha":"16246a1f72e77f1e821e7cc9084a4a7a09577b38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/16246a1f72e77f1e821e7cc9084a4a7a09577b38"}],"sha":"ae5d912d36ba13461b022c5ddc56019db96a703a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/ae5d912d36ba13461b022c5ddc56019db96a703a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/16246a1f72e77f1e821e7cc9084a4a7a09577b38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:55:31Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:55:31Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"The event export writes its workbook with fastexcel instead of Apache POI\n\nThe export only needs sheets, bold headers and column widths, and POI with its chain (xmlbeans,\ncommons-compress, commons-math3, commons-io...) was ~21 MB of the jar whose classes stayed in the\nmetaspace of the 512 MB box after the first export. fastexcel writes the same cells; the safe\nsheet names, the case-insensitive uniqueness and the column autosize POI provided are now done in\nthe writer.\n\nfastexcel zips through opczip, which ends every entry with a ZIP64 data descriptor: LibreOffice\n24 refuses such a file and ZipInputStream misreads it. The workbook is repacked through\nZipOutputStream, and a test streams every entry back to keep it that way. POI stays as a test\ndependency to read the workbook in the tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57e1e2285f68822a60a18fe101d37a9f09e9d09b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/57e1e2285f68822a60a18fe101d37a9f09e9d09b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/16246a1f72e77f1e821e7cc9084a4a7a09577b38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/16246a1f72e77f1e821e7cc9084a4a7a09577b38","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDE2MjQ2YTFmNzJlNzdmMWU4MjFlN2NjOTA4NGE0YTdhMDk1NzdiMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/7184d2da1bb1d9f66e0cd0efe9f8f508bd928b8d","sha":"7184d2da1bb1d9f66e0cd0efe9f8f508bd928b8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/7184d2da1bb1d9f66e0cd0efe9f8f508bd928b8d"}],"sha":"16246a1f72e77f1e821e7cc9084a4a7a09577b38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/16246a1f72e77f1e821e7cc9084a4a7a09577b38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/7184d2da1bb1d9f66e0cd0efe9f8f508bd928b8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:12:23Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:12:23Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Classifications read their event alone, and a stored snapshot loads no scores\n\nGetEventClassificationServiceCase hydrated the event''s entire competition, every stage, event\nand score, on each cache miss, even when a stored snapshot was about to be served. It backs the\npublic classification, the ranking matrix (one call per ranked event), the export and proof\nendpoints and the daily snapshot cron, which rehydrated the same competition for each of its\npending events.\n\nIt now reads a header projection (event, stage, competition, whether any score exists) in one\nquery, and loads the event''s own competitors, exercises, judges and scores only to compute a\nlive classification or to ask the domain whether every competitor is settled while the stage is\nstill on. A finished event with a snapshot never touches a score row. The 30 s context cache\nkeeps the header, and the event once it had to be loaded.\n\nThe latest-extraction lookup moves to LatestExtractionQuery, shared with the stage detail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"861fe8f9fa5d027256d037d54b479a1ded5b23a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/861fe8f9fa5d027256d037d54b479a1ded5b23a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/7184d2da1bb1d9f66e0cd0efe9f8f508bd928b8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/7184d2da1bb1d9f66e0cd0efe9f8f508bd928b8d","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDcxODRkMmRhMWJiMWQ5ZjY2ZTBjZDBlZmU5ZjhmNTA4YmQ5MjhiOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/fa7f76303c5d81dd0cbceb659abbf442cc64812e","sha":"fa7f76303c5d81dd0cbceb659abbf442cc64812e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/fa7f76303c5d81dd0cbceb659abbf442cc64812e"}],"sha":"7184d2da1bb1d9f66e0cd0efe9f8f508bd928b8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/7184d2da1bb1d9f66e0cd0efe9f8f508bd928b8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/fa7f76303c5d81dd0cbceb659abbf442cc64812e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:07:38Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:07:38Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"The public stage detail reads its own projection instead of the whole competition\n\nGET /stages/{id} hydrated the stage''s entire competition, every sibling stage with its scores\nincluded, on each request. It now reads the stage with its competition, its events with\nwhether they hold any score aggregated in SQL, and their competitors; the statuses come from\nEventLifecycle and StageLifecycle. Scores are only loaded while the stage has not finished by\ndate, for the events that have competitors, to ask the domain whether all of them are settled.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99d0d76ac144242101c4189912ea0835af9fe43a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/99d0d76ac144242101c4189912ea0835af9fe43a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/fa7f76303c5d81dd0cbceb659abbf442cc64812e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/fa7f76303c5d81dd0cbceb659abbf442cc64812e","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKGZhN2Y3NjMwM2M1ZDgxZGQwY2JjZWI2NTlhYmJmNDQyY2M2NDgxMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/9c15ae9ef778d4dbcd9448a5d95860aa6524d0a9","sha":"9c15ae9ef778d4dbcd9448a5d95860aa6524d0a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/9c15ae9ef778d4dbcd9448a5d95860aa6524d0a9"}],"sha":"fa7f76303c5d81dd0cbceb659abbf442cc64812e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/fa7f76303c5d81dd0cbceb659abbf442cc64812e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/9c15ae9ef778d4dbcd9448a5d95860aa6524d0a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:04:04Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:04:04Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"The extraction log reads its own projection instead of every extracted competition\n\nGET /extractions hydrated every extracted competition with all its competitors, exercises,\njudges and scores on each request, only to show stage and event headers and a competitor\ncount. It now reads two queries: the active stages with their competition and the load instant\nof its latest extraction, and their active events with the competitor count aggregated in SQL.\n\nThe competitor count and any-score subqueries move to EventProjectionFields, shared with the\nstage list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13534ecf2dd9c2d3591f9fae6a155371a1e4a127","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/13534ecf2dd9c2d3591f9fae6a155371a1e4a127"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/9c15ae9ef778d4dbcd9448a5d95860aa6524d0a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/9c15ae9ef778d4dbcd9448a5d95860aa6524d0a9","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDljMTVhZTllZjc3OGQ0ZGJjZDk0NDhhNWQ5NTg2MGFhNjUyNGQwYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/411f1da89bab95ce19b12a6b3ea48907a8d413ea","sha":"411f1da89bab95ce19b12a6b3ea48907a8d413ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/411f1da89bab95ce19b12a6b3ea48907a8d413ea"}],"sha":"9c15ae9ef778d4dbcd9448a5d95860aa6524d0a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/9c15ae9ef778d4dbcd9448a5d95860aa6524d0a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/411f1da89bab95ce19b12a6b3ea48907a8d413ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:01:17Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:01:17Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"The public stage list reads its own projection, filtered by date in SQL\n\nGET /stages hydrated every competition with all its competitors, exercises, judges and the\n54k obdx.event_scores rows on each request, then filtered the date range in Java: 1.5-2.7 s in\nproduction, and four concurrent requests ran a 459 MB box out of heap. It now reads a query\nprojection: the range and the soft deletes are filtered in SQL, the competitor count and\nwhether an event holds any score are aggregated there, and only events of stages that have not\nfinished by date are hydrated, to ask the domain whether every competitor is settled. Deleted\ncompetitions no longer leak their stages into the list.\n\nEvents are ordered by creation and then id: imported events share created_at, so ties came\nback in any order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8130f44a1599efbee043a1316b064e13ae8231e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/8130f44a1599efbee043a1316b064e13ae8231e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/411f1da89bab95ce19b12a6b3ea48907a8d413ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/411f1da89bab95ce19b12a6b3ea48907a8d413ea","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDQxMWYxZGE4OWJhYjk1Y2UxOWIxMmE2YjNlYTQ4OTA3YThkNDEzZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/8ac3b0267581b0e0a70418df6060d043f1b9fd7b","sha":"8ac3b0267581b0e0a70418df6060d043f1b9fd7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/8ac3b0267581b0e0a70418df6060d043f1b9fd7b"}],"sha":"411f1da89bab95ce19b12a6b3ea48907a8d413ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/411f1da89bab95ce19b12a6b3ea48907a8d413ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/8ac3b0267581b0e0a70418df6060d043f1b9fd7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:01:17Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:01:17Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Event and stage lifecycle rules become pure functions a read model can call\n\nEventLifecycle and StageLifecycle hold the status and enrollment rules over the few facts they\ndepend on (dates, any score recorded, every competitor settled), so a query projection can\nresolve a status without hydrating the competition. EventSnapshot and StageSnapshot delegate\nto them unchanged; the expensive facts are suppliers, still evaluated only when the date rule\nhas not decided.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7af8e07fa933bea2532b168df65d403b6554903","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/a7af8e07fa933bea2532b168df65d403b6554903"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/8ac3b0267581b0e0a70418df6060d043f1b9fd7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https