ps://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/1d827aef87c845d37add99d3376f4e569b11f32f","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDFkODI3YWVmODdjODQ1ZDM3YWRkOTlkMzM3NmY0ZTU2OWIxMWYzMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/c2871969b5c029989da7f32f7ec9efe13298a6fd","sha":"c2871969b5c029989da7f32f7ec9efe13298a6fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c2871969b5c029989da7f32f7ec9efe13298a6fd"}],"sha":"1d827aef87c845d37add99d3376f4e569b11f32f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1d827aef87c845d37add99d3376f4e569b11f32f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c2871969b5c029989da7f32f7ec9efe13298a6fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:12:50Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:12:50Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"The snapshot cron no longer runs the heap dry, and both crons can be run by hand\n\nOn 2026-09-24 the snapshot cron died of OutOfMemoryError after 587 events and left the\nJVM alive but deaf until restarted. The classification caches only checked their 30 s TTL\non read, so every event the cron computed stayed in the heap: they now expire on write and\nhold at most 200 entries. The JVM takes 70% of the box instead of 25% and exits on\nOutOfMemoryError so Fly restarts it.\n\nThe snapshot cron logs where it stops and the heap it had, and the deployed profile lets\nboth crons'' INFO lines through. POST /secured/admin/crons?cron=snapshots|dog-rank-history\nruns either one, only for the support account.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4d00f7afbfd07faddff972d9716b6dba489556b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/d4d00f7afbfd07faddff972d9716b6dba489556b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/c2871969b5c029989da7f32f7ec9efe13298a6fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/c2871969b5c029989da7f32f7ec9efe13298a6fd","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKGMyODcxOTY5YjVjMDI5OTg5ZGE3ZjMyZjdlYzllZmUxMzI5OGE2ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/cae19041c00109bcaae6955c6ccc6c95967412f9","sha":"cae19041c00109bcaae6955c6ccc6c95967412f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/cae19041c00109bcaae6955c6ccc6c95967412f9"}],"sha":"c2871969b5c029989da7f32f7ec9efe13298a6fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c2871969b5c029989da7f32f7ec9efe13298a6fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/cae19041c00109bcaae6955c6ccc6c95967412f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:08:53Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:08:53Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Public methodology endpoints, assembled from the rules that compute the rank\n\nGET /obdx/methodology and GET /k9x/methodology give the two methodology pages\ntheir figures straight from the domain: the letter scale, the competitor-count\ntiers, every current configuration''s band and category sub-bands, the merit\ncurve, the index decay curves and a worked example whose scores and index\nlines are computed with the real merit and index formulas. Only names come\nfrom the bundles, in Spanish and English at once. Both are public and\ncacheable for a day.\n\nA contract test snapshots both answers against a golden and checks the\ncontract''s invariants. Along the way the current-version rule of the\nconfiguration cache is shared, the Spanish name of RSCE grade 1 loses its\ntypo and the bundles gain the federations'' full names and the qualification\nabbreviations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d061c3b889ddc4a3b89a0ad00b105c081940bdb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/d061c3b889ddc4a3b89a0ad00b105c081940bdb9"},"url