s://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3a0e0d65f8f3da8696d30a9d71732f9c984f1d01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:27:07Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:27:07Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"A ring''s two scores count, so they are no longer flagged as trimmed\n\nexcludedIndexes trimmed the high and the low under MID_AVG whatever the number\nof scores, while average() only trims from four up. An exercise scored by the\ntwo judges of its ring (the world championship semifinals) came out with both\nscores applies=false and was shown greyed out, although the total was right.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9e0a47fc10e357d79f581dc054e629411b03641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/c9e0a47fc10e357d79f581dc054e629411b03641"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/3a0e0d65f8f3da8696d30a9d71732f9c984f1d01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/3a0e0d65f8f3da8696d30a9d71732f9c984f1d01","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDNhMGUwZDY1ZjhmM2RhODY5NmQzMGE5ZDcxNzMyZjljOTg0ZjFkMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/2c00c1c2d59f9cfefe1e21c2c3ef4b659523c12d","sha":"2c00c1c2d59f9cfefe1e21c2c3ef4b659523c12d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/2c00c1c2d59f9cfefe1e21c2c3ef4b659523c12d"}],"sha":"3a0e0d65f8f3da8696d30a9d71732f9c984f1d01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3a0e0d65f8f3da8696d30a9d71732f9c984f1d01"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/2c00c1c2d59f9cfefe1e21c2c3ef4b659523c12d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:05:00Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:05:00Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Public K9X index timeline of a dog, to chart its career\n\nGET /dogs/{identification}/index returns every snapshotted result that\nfeeds the dog''s index (k9x.snap_dog_rank), oldest first, with its event,\nstage, discipline, competition country, final position and total score,\nplus the index right after it. Alongside, a curve samples the index from\nthe first result until now, and freshnessDegradationFrom says when the\nwhole index starts fading if the dog does not compete again.\n\nThe curve is computed on read by DogRankIndexTimeline with the same\nDogRankIndex formula as the history cron, rather than read from\nsnap_dog_index_history: that history only records events and whole months\nof inactivity, not the level erosion between two events. It holds a point\nper month, one at every slope change of both curves so the corners are\nexact, and two points with the same timestamp at each event (index just\nbefore and after) so the jump can be drawn. Sampling stops at the\nfreshness floor, past which nothing moves.\n\nRank rows are read without a soft-delete filter, as the cron counts them,\nso the chart ends on the index the directory shows. A restricted\nextraction keeps the position but withholds both scores.\n\nAlso expects DKK in the federations adapter test, which fell behind when\nthe Danish configurations were added.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0790606a5f5fd982601d2b8f910329353fdd8355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/0790606a5f5fd982601d2b8f910329353fdd8355"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/2c00c1c2d59f9cfefe1e21c2c3ef4b659523c12d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/2c00c1c2d59f9cfefe1e21c2c3ef4b659523c12d","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDJjMDBjMWMyZDU5ZjljZmVmZTFlMjFjMmMzZWY0YjY1OTUyM2MxMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/3f040a8096b9f9cd7a884563eefc535862915fcb","sha":"3f040a8096b9f9cd7a884563eefc535862915fcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3f040a8096b9f9cd7a884563eefc535862915fcb"}],"sha":"2c00c1c2d59f9cfefe1e21c2c3ef4b659523c12d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/2c00c1c2d59f9cfefe1e21c2c3ef4b659523c12d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3f040a8096b9f9cd7a884563eefc535862915fcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:10:14Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:10:14Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Public participations of a dog, grouped by year\n\nGET /dogs/{identification}/participations lists every active event the dog\nwas entered in, grouped by the UTC year of its stage start, newest year and\nnewest event first. Each one carries the event, its stage (for the link to\nthe classification), the competition''s country, and the position, score and\nOBDX points frozen by the daily snapshot, which stay null until it has run.\n\nIt is a single flat query rather than a hydration of the Competition root:\na dog''s history spans many competitions and the snapshot results are not in\nthe aggregate. A restricted extraction keeps the position but withholds the\nscore and the points, as the public classification does. An inactive dog\nanswers 404, like the dog detail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64bb53c9808e2bbb8c30b0afb6924dfced5c1cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/64bb53c9808e2bbb8c30b0afb6924dfced5c1cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/3f040a8096b9f9cd7a884563eefc535862915fcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/3f040a8096b9f9cd7a884563eefc535862915fcb","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDNmMDQwYTgwOTZiOWY5Y2Q3YTg4NDU2M2VlZmM1MzU4NjI5MTVmY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/c9140764ea7f7c3d1b7c0c3485ea12f6b19e2d4b","sha":"c9140764ea7f7c3d1b7c0c3485ea12f6b19e2d4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c9140764ea7f7c3d1b7c0c3485ea12f6b19e2d4b"}],"sha":"3f040a8096b9f9cd7a884563eefc535862915fcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3f040a8096b9f9cd7a884563eefc535862915fcb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c9140764ea7f7c3d1b7c0c3485ea12f6b19e2d4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:02:58Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:02:58Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Public log of imported trials, grouped by the day they were loaded\n\nGET /extractions lists every active stage of a competition loaded by the\nexternal ETL, grouped by the UTC day its extraction was loaded and newest day\nfirst, with each stage''s events, discipline, competitor count and rank. It is\npublic, like /stages: a transparency list of what was imported and when.\n\nThe day is the load date (extraction_metadata.created_at), not the collection\ndate nor the trial date, so CompetitionExtraction gains loadedAt and the\nhydrator reads it. Only the latest extraction of a competition counts, and an\nEXTRACTION competition with no metadata row has no load date, so it is left out.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0770d5589fe3a17137392b98773de91742b0d1fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/0770d5589fe3a17137392b98773de91742b0d1fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/c9140764ea7f7c3d1b7c0c3485ea12f6b19e2d4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/c9140764ea7f7c3d1b7c0c3485ea12f6b19e2d4b","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKGM5MTQwNzY0ZWE3ZjdjM2QxYjdjMGMzNDg1ZWExMmY2YjE5ZTJkNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/af611a96e02f0ad54f4efa9b43314cc8b50d7fdf","sha":"af611a96e02f0ad54f4efa9b43314cc8b50d7fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/af611a96e02f0ad54f4efa9b43314cc8b50d7fdf"}],"sha":"c9140764ea7f7c3d1b7c0c3485ea12f6b19e2d4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c9140764ea7f7c3d1b7c0c3485ea12f6b19e2d4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/af611a96e02f0ad54f4efa9b43314cc8b50d7fdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:28:16Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:28:16Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"changes","tr