":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/4b8e79427a91559486c9368aaf77cb4235d7e6ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:25:54Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:25:54Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"seven breeds the corpus has and the enum did not\n\nThey all turn up in the NKK''s obedience trials, and they come in named by\nDogWeb''s own database, which the ETL now reads: Finnish Lapphund, Gordon\nSetter, Havanese, Japanese Spitz, Miniature Pinscher, Norwegian Buhund and\nSmall Munsterlander. Eight dogs between them.\n\nWithout a value here the ETL sends them to UNKNOWN and says so, which is the\nhonest thing for it to do but loses a breed it knows. `breed` is a VARCHAR and\nnot a database enum, so there is no migration to go with this.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72bac6ca1dd148853d9d629d407320ded3d4d662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/72bac6ca1dd148853d9d629d407320ded3d4d662"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/4b8e79427a91559486c9368aaf77cb4235d7e6ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/4b8e79427a91559486c9368aaf77cb4235d7e6ef","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDRiOGU3OTQyN2E5MTU1OTQ4NmM5MzY4YWFmNzdjYjQyMzVkN2U2ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/6e547874cc56f7961e453a6fbe81287238ffca44","sha":"6e547874cc56f7961e453a6fbe81287238ffca44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/6e547874cc56f7961e453a6fbe81287238ffca44"}],"sha":"4b8e79427a91559486c9368aaf77cb4235d7e6ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/4b8e79427a91559486c9368aaf77cb4235d7e6ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/6e547874cc56f7961e453a6fbe81287238ffca44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:59:10Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:59:10Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Attach the New Relic agent only in production, and tune the JVM for small boxes\n\nStaging on Render gets 0.1 CPU and took over five minutes to bind its port, most\nof it spent in the agent instrumenting every class as it loads — which also\ndisables the JVM''s class data sharing. The image stays the same for both\nenvironments: the entrypoint attaches the agent only when NEW_RELIC_ENABLED=true,\nwhich fly.toml sets for production.\n\nJAVA_OPTS defaults to C1-only JIT, SerialGC and a 512k thread stack, trading a\nlittle peak speed on an I/O-bound backend for a faster, lighter startup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29d6a763db98ee675a20159b66b68b3b0bcef69a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/29d6a763db98ee675a20159b66b68b3b0bcef69a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/6e547874cc56f7961e453a6fbe81287238ffca44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/6e547874cc56f7961e453a6fbe81287238ffca44","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDZlNTQ3ODc0Y2M1NmY3OTYxZTQ1M2E2ZmJlODEyODcyMzhmZmNhNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/37838f7506c64abb7973ba5aa0ca53be6c9f3f78","sha":"37838f7506c64abb7973ba5aa0ca53be6c9f3f78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/37838f7506c64abb7973ba5aa0ca53be6c9f3f78"}],"sha":"6e547874cc56f7961e453a6fbe81287238ffca44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/6e547874cc56f7961e453a6fbe81287238ffca44"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co