39ee0c445f301fc8b90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:13:25Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:13:25Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Las cincuenta razas que nueve federaciones publican y el enum no tenía\n\n`Breed` pasa de 46 valores a 96. Las que faltaban no eran una lista deseada:\nson exactamente las que el corpus del ETL trae y caían a UNKNOWN con un aviso\npor perro —135 perros del DKK, el VDH, el ÖKV, la SPKL y la SCC—, más las que\nel ENCI y la RSCE tenían anotadas en su diccionario desde que se extrajeron.\n\nDos lecturas eran ambiguas y se deciden aquí. `Collie` a secas —el DKK escribe\n`Collie, Korthåret` cuando sabe la variedad— entra como COLLIE, junto a\nSMOOTH_COLLIE y ROUGH_COLLIE para las que sí la dicen: la alternativa era\ninventarle una variedad al perro. Y el `SPIT.` del acta francesa va a\nGERMAN_SPITZ, que es el spitz que publican esas listas y el mismo que traen el\n`Deutscher Spitz` del VDH y el `Spitz Tedeschi` del ENCI.\n\nEl schnauzer mediano se llama MITTELSCHNAUZER y no STANDARD_SCHNAUZER, porque\nen este enum el gigante y el enano ya se llaman en alemán.\n\nY de paso las nueve que estaban en el enum sin traducir en ningún idioma\n—AIREDALE_TERRIER, ALASKAN_MALAMUTE, APUAN_ALPS_SHEPHERD_DOG,\nBELGIAN_SHEPHERD_GROENENDAEL, ENGLISH_COCKER_SPANIEL, OROPA_SHEPHERD_DOG,\nSHETLAND_SHEEPDOG, SIBERIAN_HUSKY y WHIPPET—: `BreedEnumAdapter` cae al nombre\ndel enum cuando no hay clave, así que la API las servía como\n`WHITE_SWISS_SHEPHERD_DOG`. Los cuatro `messages*.properties` quedan con una\nclave por valor, 96 y 96.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8ed44dc917a7a2d0237d2112611a2c381b7b80b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/a8ed44dc917a7a2d0237d2112611a2c381b7b80b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/151eabf47496085e8b87c39ee0c445f301fc8b90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/151eabf47496085e8b87c39ee0c445f301fc8b90","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDE1MWVhYmY0NzQ5NjA4NWU4Yjg3YzM5ZWUwYzQ0NWYzMDFmYzhiOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/538aec8864b5c31e63e179c002a45dfe26149c4d","sha":"538aec8864b5c31e63e179c002a45dfe26149c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/538aec8864b5c31e63e179c002a45dfe26149c4d"}],"sha":"151eabf47496085e8b87c39ee0c445f301fc8b90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/151eabf47496085e8b87c39ee0c445f301fc8b90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/538aec8864b5c31e63e179c002a45dfe26149c4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:39:27Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:39:27Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"La SCC, el VDH y el ÖKV tenían nombre en la base de datos y no en el bundle\n\n`extractionParamName` traduce el parámetro del tipo de extracción con\n`federation.<x>.name` y, cuando no existe la clave, **cae al token crudo**. Sin\nerror y sin log: la frase sale «Resultados publicados en la página de la\nfederación vdh», en minúscula y en medio de una frase en español.\n\nFaltaban tres, no dos: las 13 competiciones que el ETL acaba de marcar\n`FEDERATION_PAGE,vdh` y `FEDERATION_PAGE,okv` —las doce rondas de la serie\nalemana que el VDH publica en PDF y el trial austríaco de Grafenwörth, que no\nestá en caniva—, y además `scc`, que llevaba seis competiciones cargadas\nenseñando el mismo agujero desde antes.\n\nY el guardia que existe para esto, `names_every_federation_that_can_appear_as_a_parameter`,\nrecorría siete federaciones: no miraba ni `scc` ni `spkl`. Ahora recorre las\nonce que pueden aparecer como parámetro, que es lo que su nombre promete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51551a7fd331188dbef250f8dd8fff462f2b5dda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/51551a7fd331188dbef250f8dd8fff462f2b5dda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/538aec8864b5c31e63e179c002a45dfe26149c4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/538aec8864b5c31e63e179c002a45dfe26149c4d","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDUzOGFlYzg4NjRiNWMzMWU2M2UxNzljMDAyYTQ1ZGZlMjYxNDljNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/c2a81ed2e69c9877ef0af5053bb1e9eb83730d57","sha":"c2a81ed2e69c9877ef0af5053bb1e9eb83730d57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c2a81ed2e69c9877ef0af5053bb1e9eb83730d57"}],"sha":"538aec8864b5c31e63e179c002a45dfe26149c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/538aec8864b5c31e63e179c002a45dfe26149c4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c2a81ed2e69c9877ef0af5053bb1e9eb83730d57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:09:18Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:09:18Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Las notificaciones se apagan y encienden en la cuenta, no en el dispositivo\n\nEl interruptor pasa a users.notifications_enabled: apagarlo silencia todos los\ndispositivos del usuario y encenderlo los recupera todos, sin tener que visitar\ncada navegador. Las suscripciones ya no se borran al desactivar, porque sus\nclaves las genera el navegador y el servidor no podria recrearlas.\n\nRegistrar un dispositivo (POST) deja de expresar intencion: el cliente reenvia\nsu endpoint en cada arranque, mucho despues de haberse concedido el permiso, y\ntratarlo como un \"si\" reactivaba en silencio una cuenta que el usuario acababa\nde silenciar desde otro sitio. Ahora es un upsert que no toca el flag, y quien\nlo escribe es el PUT /secured/notification-enabled.\n\nEl envio filtra por la cuenta con un join en GetPushSubscriptions, asi que valen\nlos dos caminos; la fila de inbox se sigue guardando aunque no se envie push. El\nflag se lee fresco en /secured/user y no desde UserInfoDTO, que esta cacheado por\nsesion y devolveria un valor rancio tras cada cambio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82be105c3d19f7e3111b2868113275146d8f00ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/82be105c3d19f7e3111b2868113275146d8f00ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/c2a81ed2e69c9877ef0af5053bb1e9eb83730d57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/c2a81ed2e69c9877ef0af5053bb1e9eb83730d57","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKGMyYTgxZWQyZTY5Yzk4NzdlZjBhZjUwNTNiYjFlOWViODM3MzBkNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/1fde77bd93dada001e3a9b186925915d321e6e69","sha":"1fde77bd93dada001e3a9b186925915d321e6e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1fde77bd93dada001e3a9b186925915d321e6e69"}],"sha":"c2a81ed2e69c9877ef0af5053bb1e9eb83730d57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c2a81ed2e69c9877ef0af5053bb1e9eb83730d57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1fde77bd93dada001e3a9b186925915d321e6e69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T19:05:47Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T19:05:47Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"El reglamento FCI de 2016 entra en el backend, y cada versión pasa a llamarse por su año\n\nFaltaba el reglamento de obedience de la FCI anterior al 1 de enero de 2022. Sin él, toda prueba de\n2020 o 2021 —el CPC entero de esos dos años, las dos primeras Coupes de France, la ENCI de 2021 y\nlas dos primeras ediciones del European Open— se quedaba sin configuración con la que decir cómo se\npuntuó, y no es un detalle de etiquetado: el backend recalcula el total con los coeficientes de la\nconfiguración del evento, y los dos reglamentos no los tienen iguales. La clase 1 de 2016 tiene\nONCE ejercicios y la de 2022, nueve.\n\nSe dan de alta las tres clases en `fci/grade_{1,2,3}/v2016/`, con los coeficientes 3,3,3,3,2,3,4,3,3,3,2\n· 2,3,3,4,4,3,4,4,3,2 · 2,2,3,3,4,4,3,4,3,4. Suman 32 y dan 320, igual que las de 2022, así que los\ntotales de aquellos años siguen siendo comparables con los de ahora —lo que no se puede es meterlos\nen la configuración que no es—. Los coeficientes están comprobados dos veces: contra el reglamento\npublicado y contra los catorce días de las siete ediciones del European Open, donde salen de dividir\nlos puntos entre la nota fila a fila (`k9x-etl/docs/vdh-reglamento-fci-2020-2021.md`).\n\nLos desempates de 2016 no venían en el reglamento que se consultó, así que son los MISMOS ejercicios\nque rompen el empate en la de 2022, localizados por lo que son: en los grados 2 y 3 caen en el mismo\nnúmero, y en el 1 no, porque 2016 tiene once ejercicios y otro orden. Las bandas (256/224/192) y los\nvalores de nota admitidos se mantienen.\n\nY las versiones dejan de ser un contador para ser **el año de entrada en vigor**, que es lo que\npermite elegir la que tocaba con el año de la prueba: la más alta que no lo pase. Las once\nconfiguraciones nacionales que no cambian —el COBS portugués, las dos italianas, la finlandesa, las\ntres suecas y las tres noruegas— pasan a `V2016`, que es el suelo; el brevet francés a `V2024`, que\nes su reglamento; y el grado 1 español a `V2026`, que es cuando la RSCE deja de correr el de la FCI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5caaf5deeb71441d19854de435f4b881fa310a2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/5caaf5deeb71441d19854de435f4b881fa310a2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/1fde77bd93dada001e3a9b186925915d321e6e69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/1fde77bd93dada001e3a9b186925915d321e6e69","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDFmZGU3N2JkOTNkYWRhMDAxZTNhOWIxODY5MjU5MTVkMzIxZTZlNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/1762d31fe1925b364355a42e28a64c3bef76f2db","sha":"1762d31fe1925b364355a42e28a64c3bef76f2db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1762d31fe1925b364355a42e28a64c3bef76f2db"}],"sha":"1fde77bd93dada001e3a9b186925915d321e6e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1fde77bd93dada001e3a9b186925915d321e6e69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1762d31fe1925b364355a42e28a64c3bef76f2db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:28:57Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:28:57Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"El listado de configuraciones por federación solo ofrece la versión vigente\n\nCon una sola versión por clase el listado podía devolver el cache entero. Al entrar la v2021 y la\nv2016 dejaría de valer: el organizador vería la misma clase tres veces, una por reglamento, sin nada\nque le dijera cuál elegir.\n\nEl cache pasa a saber de qué clase y de qué año es cada fichero —lo dice el propio path,\n`federations/<fed>/<clase>/v<año>/configuration.json`— y el adaptador del listado se queda con el año\nmás alto de cada federación y clase. Las versiones anteriores siguen cargadas, porque los eventos ya\npuntuados referencian sus ids y los adaptadores de puntuación y de valores permitidos los buscan ahí.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ba179da0ae1e5335b026152be407a6bd824c729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/9ba179da0ae1e5335b026152be407a6bd824c729"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/1762d31fe1925b364355a42e28a64c3bef76f2db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/1762d31fe1925b364355a42e28a64c3bef76f2db","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDE3NjJkMzFmZTE5MjViMzY0MzU1YTQyZTI4YTY0YzNiZWY3NmYyZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/e40162e51e11121ee95e26ffbbd9f9f3fd9266b5","sha":"e40162e51e11121ee95e26ffbbd9f9f3fd9266b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/e40162e51e11121ee95e26ffbbd9f9f3fd9266b5"}],"sha":"1762d31fe1925b364355a42e28a64c3bef76f2db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/1762d31fe1925b364355a42e28a64c3bef76f2db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/e40162e51e11121ee95e26ffbbd9f9f3fd9266b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:59:03Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:59:03Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"i18n","tree":{"sha":"487e3139bb097571b42b9130f2422abaf691b86c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/487e3139bb097571b42b9130f2422abaf691b86c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/e40162e51e11121ee95e26ffbbd9f9f3fd9266b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/e40162e51e11121ee95e26ffbbd9f9f3fd9266b5","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKGU0MDE2MmU1MWUxMTEyMWVlOTVlMjZmZmJiZDlmOWYzZmQ5MjY2YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/34174e22c91297c1fffe2ca30be2967a852241f0","sha":"34174e22c91297c1fffe2ca30be2967a852241f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/34174e22c91297c1fffe2ca30be2967a852241f0"}],"sha":"e40162e51e11121ee95e26ffbbd9f9f3fd9266b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/e40162e51e11121ee95e26ffbbd9f9f3fd9266b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/34174e22c91297c1fffe2ca30be2967a852241f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:18Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:18Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Las configuraciones dejan de llamarse V0 y pasan a llamarse por el año, V2022\n\n`V0` no decía nada: era un contador que empezaba en cero y que no se podía leer sin abrir el\nfichero para ver de qué reglamento hablaba. El año sí lo dice, y es lo que distingue de verdad\nuna configuración de la siguiente, porque lo que cambia es el reglamento que se publica.\n\nLas dieciséis configuraciones —todas las federaciones, todas las clases— pasan a\n`OBDX.<FED>_<CLASE>.V2022`, sus ejercicios a `OBDX.<FED>_<CLASE>.N_V2022`, y el directorio de\ncada una de `v0/` a `v2022/`. El descubrimiento no se toca: el cache ya buscaba por\n`federations/**/configuration.json` y nunca nombró la versión.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aee9c9e8ed8969188c0ac530e9627cad441b7b0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/aee9c9e8ed8969188c0ac530e9627cad441b7b0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/34174e22c91297c1fffe2ca30be2967a852241f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/34174e22c91297c1fffe2ca30be2967a852241f0","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDM0MTc0ZTIyYzkxMjk3YzFmZmZlMmNhMzBiZTI5NjdhODUyMjQxZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/72f78eb68d00e37974a521825e8becc4b6fe6abc","sha":"72f78eb68d00e37974a521825e8becc4b6fe6abc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/72f78eb68d00e37974a521825e8becc4b6fe6abc"}],"sha":"34174e22c91297c1fffe2ca30be2967a852241f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/34174e22c91297c1fffe2ca30be2967a852241f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/72f78eb68d00e37974a521825e8becc4b6fe6abc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:13:39Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:13:39Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Una extracción restringida se carga entera y sale sin puntuaciones\n\nDogWeb pide permiso escrito para republicar sus resultados, así que las cinco\nselectivas noruegas entran con `restricted` en `k9x.extraction_metadata` —columna\nnueva en la V1—. No cambia nada de lo que se guarda ni de lo que se calcula: la\nagregación, el snapshot, la caché, los totales de ranking y el índice del perro\nsiguen saliendo de los puntos reales. Por eso se vacía en el borde REST y no en\nel caso de uso, que es por donde pasa el ranking antes de sumar.\n\n`WithheldScores` es esa regla en un sitio, y la aplican los tres que piden una\nclasificación: la pública, el Excel y el acta. El ranking anula la celda de los\neventos restringidos y deja el total del grupo como estaba. Y la extracción\ncontesta con un kind propio —`extraction.type.restricted.hint`— y sin `source`:\nnombrar la página, o la federación que lleva dentro el tipo, sería republicar\njusto lo que la restricción prohíbe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34b9d09b61674aaf5640cd8c2935b6c495f3472a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/34b9d09b61674aaf5640cd8c2935b6c495f3472a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/72f78eb68d00e37974a521825e8becc4b6fe6abc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/72f78eb68d00e37974a521825e8becc4b6fe6abc","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDcyZjc4ZWI2OGQwMGUzNzk3NGE1MjE4MjVlOGJlY2M0YjZmZTZhYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/6aaa9ec83143189776879eebf282b2a7dbe20745","sha":"6aaa9ec83143189776879eebf282b2a7dbe20745","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/6aaa9ec83143189776879eebf282b2a7dbe20745"}],"sha":"72f78eb68d00e37974a521825e8becc4b6fe6abc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/72f78eb68d00e37974a521825e8becc4b6fe6abc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/6aaa9ec83143189776879eebf282b2a7dbe20745/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:16:36Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:16:45Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"NKK: las tres clases nacionales noruegas, klasse 1, 2 y 3\n\nLa NKK corre en la misma prueba la clase FCI 3 y tres clases nacionales suyas, con\nreglamento propio -el vigente desde 2024, mismo programa que el de 2022- y ejercicios\nque no son los de los grados FCI: tilgjengelighet, neseprove, fremadsending rundt\nkjegler. Sin estas configuraciones, sus eventos no se pueden cargar.\n\nNueve ejercicios la 1 y la 2, diez la 3; en las tres la suma de coeficientes es 32, o\nsea los 320 puntos de siempre, y los mismos tres calificativos que las demas clases:\n256 / 224 / 192. Valores admitidos, los del reglamento (0 y de 5 a 10 de medio en\nmedio).\n\nEl desempate NO lo dice el reglamento, asi que sigue el patron del repo: los\nejercicios de coeficiente 4 -lineforing/fri ved fot y el control a distancia- y la\nimpresion general, que es tambien la que rompe el empate del empate.\n\nLas bandas de rank_score: klasse 1 en [201, 400] y klasse 2 en [401, 600], las de los\ngrados 1 y 2. La klasse 3 en [601, 750] y no en [601, 1000]: es del nivel del grado 3\n-prueba de olfato y dirigido incluidos- pero es NACIONAL, el mundial se corre en la\nclase FCI y no en ella, asi que alcanza exactamente lo que el grado 3 alcanza en CLUB\ny OPEN y ni un punto mas. Con la banda entera, un OPEN suyo valdria 1000, lo mismo que\nuna final del mundial.\n\nSus seis ejercicios colectivos -los tres fellesdekk/felles sitt y las tres impresiones\ngenerales- entran en LiveExcludedExercise, que es lo que evita que un perro se quede\nLIVE por lo que se puntua a campo entero.\n\nY ObdxConfigurationGrade aprende a leer KLASSE_n ademas de GRADE_n y GRADO_n: la NKK\nnumera sus clases igual que la FCI y el RSCE, asi que el cuaderno imprime \"1\" y no el\nnombre traducido de la configuracion.\n\nVan tambien en este commit, por peticion expresa, los cambios que ya estaban en el\narbol de trabajo y no son de esta tarea: las tres configuraciones nacionales suecas\n(OBDX.SKK_STARTKLASS, OBDX.SKK_KLASS_1 y OBDX.SKK_KLASS_2) con sus traducciones. Por\neso el test del adaptador pasa de cinco federaciones a siete de una vez.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5646cce033cc53df282fd13fd329f3d14c730b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/d5646cce033cc53df282fd13fd329f3d14c730b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/6aaa9ec83143189776879eebf282b2a7dbe20745","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t