nizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/4b09cc2f90fe7eb6d8cc5bb16940b231060a49d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:33:07Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:33:07Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Breed: el cocker spaniel inglés, que traen tres federaciones\n\nSalía en el corpus del RSCE —`COCKER SPANIEL INGLES`, un perro de la Copa de\nEspaña de 2023—, en el de la SCC, donde los concours de club lo abrevian `COC.`,\ny en el del ENCI como `Cocker Spaniel Inglese`. Las tres lo leían bien y las tres\nlo dejaban caer a UNKNOWN, que es lo que pedía ampliar el enum.\n\nCon el valor puesto, las tres empiezan a mapearlo con el mismo cambio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c40e97bf9f58ecf1884975882d0bf346eb6ff56c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/c40e97bf9f58ecf1884975882d0bf346eb6ff56c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/4b09cc2f90fe7eb6d8cc5bb16940b231060a49d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/4b09cc2f90fe7eb6d8cc5bb16940b231060a49d0","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDRiMDljYzJmOTBmZTdlYjZkOGNjNWJiMTY5NDBiMjMxMDYwYTQ5ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/3ac1ed39b4f5f4a32ad8a5c8c84f7cdccfff9624","sha":"3ac1ed39b4f5f4a32ad8a5c8c84f7cdccfff9624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3ac1ed39b4f5f4a32ad8a5c8c84f7cdccfff9624"}],"sha":"4b09cc2f90fe7eb6d8cc5bb16940b231060a49d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/4b09cc2f90fe7eb6d8cc5bb16940b231060a49d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3ac1ed39b4f5f4a32ad8a5c8c84f7cdccfff9624/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:44:34Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:44:34Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"dogs: detalle publico de perro\n\nGET /dogs/{identification}, sin securizar como el listado.\n\nDevuelve todo lo que k9x.dogs sabe del perro menos el owner, el creador y la\nfecha de creacion: los tres hablan de los usuarios de la app, no del perro.\nTampoco viaja deleted_at, que por el filtro siempre seria null.\n\nReutiliza GetDogPersistencePort en vez de traer un adaptador nuevo: su consulta\nya filtra deleted_at IS NULL y devuelve null si no hay fila, de modo que un\nperro borrado y uno inexistente responden lo mismo (404 via\nDogNotFoundException). Es deliberado: que un perro fuese borrado no es algo que\nun lector anonimo tenga que averiguar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e347d83d744f921d5a640192c5a5da27f6a8076d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/e347d83d744f921d5a640192c5a5da27f6a8076d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/3ac1ed39b4f5f4a32ad8a5c8c84f7cdccfff9624","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/3ac1ed39b4f5f4a32ad8a5c8c84f7cdccfff9624","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDNhYzFlZDM5YjRmNWY0YTMyYWQ4YTVjOGM4NGY3Y2RjY2ZmZjk2MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/9a24387dde59594253be2f15b55692e051c2e580","sha":"9a24387dde59594253be2f15b55692e051c2e580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/9a24387dde59594253be2f15b55692e051c2e580"}],"sha":"3ac1ed39b4f5f4a32ad8a5c8c84f7cdccfff9624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/3ac1ed39b4f5f4a32ad8a5c8c84f7cdccfff9624"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/9a24387dde59594253be2f15b55692e051c2e580/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:41:23Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:41:23Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"SCC_BREVET: el grado de entrada de la federacion francesa\n\nLos concours de club de la SCC corren cuatro clases y la primera es el Brevet\nNational d''Obeissance, que no es un grado FCI: tiene su propio reglamento\n-aplicable desde el 01/01/2024- con once ejercicios y coeficientes propios,\nsociabilidad con congeneres y con humanos entre ellos. Sin esta configuracion,\nsus eventos no se pueden cargar.\n\nOnce ejercicios de coeficiente 3 3 2 4 3 3 4 3 3 2 2 = 32, o sea los 320 puntos\nde siempre, y los mismos tres calificativos que las demas clases: 256 / 224 /\n192. Los valores admitidos son los del reglamento (0 y de 5 a 10 de medio en\nmedio).\n\nEl desempate NO lo dice el reglamento, asi que sigue el patron de FCI grade 1:\nlos ejercicios de coeficiente 4 -suite au pied y rappel- y la impresion general,\nque es tambien la que rompe el empate del empate.\n\nBanda de rank_score [100, 200], la que ya comparten el COBS del CPC, los\ndebuttanti del ENCI, el debutante del RSCE y la ALO finlandesa: es el mismo\nescalon de iniciacion. Y sus dos ejercicios colectivos -la absence couchee y la\nimpresion general- entran en LiveExcludedExercise, que es lo que evita que un\nperro se quede LIVE por lo que se puntua a campo entero.\n\nEl test del adaptador enumera las federaciones y ahora son seis.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62903f37e6b766847a04119a18f1f41dc8a91b5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/62903f37e6b766847a04119a18f1f41dc8a91b5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/9a24387dde59594253be2f15b55692e051c2e580","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/9a24387dde59594253be2f15b55692e051c2e580","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDlhMjQzODdkZGU1OTU5NDI1M2JlMmYxNWI1NTY5MmUwNTFjMmU1ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/57512ecf061c74943b793c9ad409694f3d129f68","sha":"57512ecf061c74943b793c9ad409694f3d129f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/57512ecf061c74943b793c9ad409694f3d129f68"}],"sha":"9a24387dde59594253be2f15b55692e051c2e580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/9a24387dde59594253be2f15b55692e051c2e580"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/57512ecf061c74943b793c9ad409694f3d129f68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:30:24Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:30:24Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Breed: ocho razas que el ENCI trae y el enum no tenia\n\nTodas salen del corpus de sport.enci.it y estaban cayendo a UNKNOWN con el\naviso de ampliar el enum: airedale terrier, malamute de Alaska, pastore delle\nAlpi Apuane, groenendael, pastore d''Oropa, shetland, husky siberiano y whippet.\n\nEl groenendael y el shetland ya tenian canonico en la SCC y el shetland tambien\nen el RSCE, asi que los tres empiezan a mapearse con este mismo cambio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3941bdc6f220a826975bb244e24df9972f2b8a73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/3941bdc6f220a826975bb244e24df9972f2b8a73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/57512ecf061c74943b793c9ad409694f3d129f68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/57512ecf061c74943b793c9ad409694f3d129f68","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDU3NTEyZWNmMDYxYzc0OTQzYjc5M2M5YWQ0MDk2OTRmM2QxMjlmNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/c36fd42ee7acd0b77e41b961e0d1a045493ee7fe","sha":"c36fd42ee7acd0b77e41b961e0d1a045493ee7fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c36fd42ee7acd0b77e41b961e0d1a045493ee7fe"}],"sha":"57512ecf061c74943b793c9ad409694f3d129f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/57512ecf061c74943b793c9ad409694f3d129f68"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c36fd42ee7acd0b77e41b961e0d1a045493ee7fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:12:31Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:12:31Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"dogs: directorio publico paginado de perros\n\nGET /dogs, sin securizar: fuera de /secured/, asi que el filtro Auth lo deja\npasar sin token y el endpoint no recibe UserInfoDTO.\n\nFiltra por nombre de perro, guia y pais (los tres en la misma consulta, con\nAND) y devuelve identificacion, nombre, guia, pais, sexo, raza y el indice K9X.\n\nEl indice se resuelve con un LEFT JOIN sobre un derivado distinct on\n(dog_identification) ordenado por applying_timestamp desc: el registro vigente\nes el de mayor instante de efecto, el mismo criterio que ya usa el cron de\nhistorial. El filtro va en el ON y no en el WHERE para no perder los perros que\ntodavia no han competido; para esos, el use case traduce el null a\nDogRankIndex.NOT_GENERATED (\"NO_K9X_INDEX_GENERATED\"), que es una ausencia y no\nuna puntuacion baja.\n\nOrdena siempre por indice descendente con los perros sin indice al final\n(nulls last, que no es el defecto de Postgres con desc), y nombre e\nidentificacion como desempate para que las paginas sean estables. El count de\nla paginacion no hace el join, porque todos los filtros son sobre dogs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"647b267708b7bae007e24de0c1607a9c7316c3ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/647b267708b7bae007e24de0c1607a9c7316c3ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/c36fd42ee7acd0b77e41b961e0d1a045493ee7fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/c36fd42ee7acd0b77e41b961e0d1a045493ee7fe","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKGMzNmZkNDJlZTdhY2QwYjc3ZTQxYjk2MWUwZDFhMDQ1NDkzZWU3ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/796c193252a8006c170b0ccaa14bd2e85023d8d2","sha":"796c193252a8006c170b0ccaa14bd2e85023d8d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/796c193252a8006c170b0ccaa14bd2e85023d8d2"}],"sha":"c36fd42ee7acd0b77e41b961e0d1a045493ee7fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/c36fd42ee7acd0b77e41b961e0d1a045493ee7fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/796c193252a8006c170b0ccaa14bd2e85023d8d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T13:29:26Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T13:29:26Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Virtual threads en toda la aplicacion\n\nActiva spring.threads.virtual.enabled, con lo que Tomcat sirve cada request\nen un virtual thread y @Async/@Scheduled pasan a los SimpleAsyncTask\n{Executor,Scheduler} virtuales.\n\nTodo el I/O saliente ya era compatible: no hay ningun RestTemplate, las dos\nllamadas HTTP (Nominatim y el intercambio de codigo de Google) usan\njava.net.http.HttpClient, y el driver pgjdbc bloquea sobre sockets normales.\nSus bloques synchronized dejaron de fijar el carrier thread en Java 25\n(JEP 491), que es la version del toolchain y de la imagen de Docker.\n\nAsyncPushNotifier gestionaba sus propios threads, asi que su pool fijo de 2\nthreads de plataforma pasa tambien a un virtual thread por entrega. Se\nconserva el nombre push-notifier-N mediante una factory explicita, util en\nlogs y en las trazas de New Relic. Como contrapartida, las entregas de push\nya no estan limitadas a dos en paralelo: si una rafaga de notificaciones\nllegase a saturar el pool de Hikari, el sitio donde acotarlas es dispatch().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2510a9424f0f5bda966355af7a4b2c9e31062dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/2510a9424f0f5bda966355af7a4b2c9e31062dae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/796c193252a8006c170b0ccaa14bd2e85023d8d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/796c193252a8006c170b0ccaa14bd2e85023d8d2","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDc5NmMxOTMyNTJhODAwNmMxNzBiMGNjYWExNGJkMmU4NTAyM2Q4ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/b7b48b2b59afba85defabf01d0cae2d507963f40","sha":"b7b48b2b59afba85defabf01d0cae2d507963f40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/b7b48b2b59afba85defabf01d0cae2d507963f40"}],"sha":"796c193252a8006c170b0ccaa14bd2e85023d8d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/796c193252a8006c170b0ccaa14bd2e85023d8d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/b7b48b2b59afba85defabf01d0cae2d507963f40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T12:49:45Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T12:49:45Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"Breed: beauceron y briard\n\nTres perros de la Coupe de France los llevan y compiten -GLAZ DU (briard, 2020\ny 2021), JUSTICE BLEU (beauceron, 2022) y ORSON (beauceron, 2025)-, y entraban\nen UNKNOWN porque el enum no tenía valor para ellos. BEAUCE_SHEPHERD y BRIARD\nson los nombres FCI en inglés, como el resto del enum, con su etiqueta en los\ncuatro ficheros de i18n.\n\nY de paso el juez sintetico ''UNKNOWN'' sale de la siembra: las plazas anonimas\nque firman las notas de un evento cuya fuente no nombra a sus jueces van SIEMPRE\nnumeradas -UNKNOWN_1, UNKNOWN_2...- y cada importacion crea las que necesita, asi\nque la siembra no tiene que adivinar cuantas son. El ''UNKNOWN'' sin numero\nconvivia con las numeradas y hacia que un mismo evento pudiera ensenar una plaza\nde mas. El dominio sigue aceptando las dos formas (ObdxFinalScoreExercise).","tree":{"sha":"963d4227b7687a722ec2562d988d094b199ca3f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/963d4227b7687a722ec2562d988d094b199ca3f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/b7b48b2b59afba85defabf01d0cae2d507963f40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node