ción que puede estar ya aplicada. Flyway\nse niega a arrancar con «Migration checksum mismatch for version 1» contra\ncualquier base que la tenga registrada. Vale para una base que se recrea desde\ncero; si no, hace falta `flyway repair`.","tree":{"sha":"33ae44c715d04fd70c46e5e75b2f6ac1955fd3b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/33ae44c715d04fd70c46e5e75b2f6ac1955fd3b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/37ee30c241bee8f2a75cca9ac8b6d7075bfa1013","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/37ee30c241bee8f2a75cca9ac8b6d7075bfa1013","node_id":"C_kwDORFuh_NoAKDM3ZWUzMGMyNDFiZWU4ZjJhNzVjY2E5YWM4YjZkNzA3NWJmYTEwMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/txomin55/k9x-backend/commit/8ac27a54facdec6f7708a4debfa325c2cac72790","sha":"8ac27a54facdec6f7708a4debfa325c2cac72790","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/8ac27a54facdec6f7708a4debfa325c2cac72790"}],"sha":"37ee30c241bee8f2a75cca9ac8b6d7075bfa1013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/37ee30c241bee8f2a75cca9ac8b6d7075bfa1013"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/8ac27a54facdec6f7708a4debfa325c2cac72790/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T19:05:16Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T19:05:16Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"V2: k9x.extraction_metadata, de dónde salió una competición EXTRACTION\n\n`k9x.competitions.source` ya distingue las filas que creó la app (`API`) de las\nque cargó un ETL externo (`EXTRACTION`). Lo que no había era el detalle de esas\nsegundas: de dónde salió el material y cuándo se recogió.\n\nSin eso la procedencia vive solo en quien descargó los folios y se pierde en\ncuanto lo olvida, que es justo lo que hace falta para volver a la fuente cuando\nun dato se discute, y para saber cuánto fiarse de una evidencia.\n\nUna fila por edición. La escribe el ETL desde un `event_metadata.json` que se\nmantiene a mano junto al material.\n\nDos columnas de tiempo, y no sobra ninguna: `extraction_timestamp` es cuándo se\nrecogió la evidencia y `created_at` cuándo entró la fila. Se diferencian a\nmenudo por meses — un folio de 2020 se puede recoger en 2025 y cargar hoy.\n\n`type` lleva un vocabulario cerrado más parámetros separados por comas\n(`''FEDERATION_PAGE,cpc''`, `''PRIVATE_CONVERSATIONS,ORGANIZER''`). Es el ETL quien\nlos une, y rechaza un parámetro que lleve una coma dentro: así el primer token\nes siempre el tipo.\n\nEl índice por `competition_id` no es único a propósito: una competición se puede\nreextraer desde una fuente mejor, y entonces son dos filas.","tree":{"sha":"915b8fe40d708a0edacabaf7b061c266631c69af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/915b8fe40d708a0edacabaf7b061c266631c69af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/8ac27a54facdec6f7708a4debfa325c2cac72790","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/txomin-sirera","id":131660321,"login":"txomin-sirera","node_id":"U_kgDOB9j6IQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/repos","site_admin":false,"starr