ps://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/commits/ae6626649fc7edfe0ea8ccc39d3195b32fce3bd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:44:43Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:44:43Z","email":"txomin.sirera@clarity.ai","name":"txomin"},"message":"snapshot handler/country/team on competitor inclusion\n\nThe dog''s handler, country and team are now frozen onto obdx.event_competitors when the dog is\nincluded in an event, by enrollment or by the organizer''s event update, so an already-run event\nkeeps showing who competed and for whom after the dog record changes.\n\nThe rule is explicit in the domain as CompetitorDogSnapshot: of(dog) takes the current state,\natInclusion(...) keeps the snapshot an already-included competitor joined with (the event update\nrewrites the whole competitor list) and fills in rows predating the snapshot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a68e29311c391fb9dfe726a294cbab60a6f9fd12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/trees/a68e29311c391fb9dfe726a294cbab60a6f9fd12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txomin55/k9x-backend/git/commits/ae6626649fc7edfe0ea8ccc39d3195b32fce3bd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131660321?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-sirera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/txomin-si