tate no longer leak into\n  the frozen contract. d.ts 33.3→30.3 KB; public-api.spec green.\n- B3: replace hardcoded Spanish strings in login-setup dialog with i18n keys\n  (LOGIN_SETUP_FUNCTIONS_DETECTED, LOGIN_SETUP_BLOCK_ASSIGN) in all 5 languages.\n- B4: raise configuration.ts coverage 78.19%→85.21% (login-setup save +\n  issue-tracker DOM wiring tests).\n\nShould-fix:\n- F1: broaden credential redaction (substring + exact matcher; catches apiKey,\n  pwd, sessionId, idToken, clientSecret, privateKey, pin, otp, ssn, card fields;\n  no false positives). redact.utils.ts 100% coverage.\n- F2: sync README PersistenceService API with actual .d.ts.\n- F3: add CHANGELOG.md.\n- Escaping: single-quote escape assertion selector and interceptor wildcard/\n  fixture path to avoid invalid generated Cypress code.\n\nDeferred (ROADMAP backlog): F4 login-setup surface, F5 recorder decomposition,\nF6 magic-string keys, remaining LOW/INFO polish, devDep advisories.\n\nGates: lint ✓ · build ✓ · 1083 tests ✓ · coverage 94.65/87.45/95.38 ✓.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c62e5c965137b9fd48d0515e9fce27e34d566fd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GonzaloCarmenado/lib-e2e-cypress-for-dummys-ts/git/trees/c62e5c965137b9fd48d0515e9fce27e34d566fd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GonzaloCarmenado/lib-e2e-cypress-for-dummys-ts/git/commits/13c274c92851f804cd802a2ee6e63e9aa4d1ed85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163729672?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aargoncar","id":163729672,"login":"a