ón del click previo al file input\n\nCaso E añadido al laboratorio del ejemplo con input único,\ninput múltiple, instrucciones de las dos bifurcaciones a probar\ny expected output para cada una.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57c300c9bc1bebd14e33bf4b62fe214d12dbb1e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GonzaloCarmenado/lib-e2e-cypress-for-dummys-ts/git/trees/57c300c9bc1bebd14e33bf4b62fe214d12dbb1e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GonzaloCarmenado/lib-e2e-cypress-for-dummys-ts/git/commits/5e7b6fa4830c56482e0bc5dda0814a71b40f0ff7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163729672?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aargoncar","id":163729672,"login":"aargoncar","node_id":"U_kgDOCcJRCA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GonzaloCarmenado/lib-e2e-cypress-for-dummys-ts/commit/5e7b6fa4830c56482e0bc5dda0814a71b40f0ff7","node_id":"C_kwDORFuyzdoAKDVlN2I2ZmE0ODMwYzU2NDgyZTBiYzVkZGEwODE0YTcxYjQwZjBmZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GonzaloCarmenado/lib-e2e-cypress-for-dummys-ts/commit/f3db010a363366cabb183773504d9c0769244148","sha":"