users/aargoncar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aargoncar","id":163729672,"login":"aargoncar","node_id":"U_kgDOCcJRCA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aargoncar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GonzaloCarmenado/lib-e2e-cypress-for-dummys-ts/commits/93b36442df3658c1966ae72a2ad354efecdf1e5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T12:17:40Z","email":"gonzalo.carmenado@iesa.es","name":"Gonzalo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T12:17:40Z","email":"gonzalo.carmenado@iesa.es","name":"Gonzalo"},"message":"fix(ac-03): redact sensitive fields in HTTP fixtures and cy.wait validations\n\nNew redactSensitiveFields() in src/utils/redact.utils.ts recursively\nreplaces values for password/token/secret/authorization/cookie/\naccess_token/refresh_token (case-insensitive) with \"[REDACTED]\"\nbefore they reach generated test code or fixture files.\n\nApplied at four points in http-monitor.ts:\n- Fetch + XHR fixture registration (registerFixture path)\n- Fetch + XHR cy.wait validation generation (buildCyWaitCommand path)\n\n23 unit tests cover all seven patterns, case-insensitivity, nested\nobjects, arrays, deep nesting, primitives, and immutability.\n5 integration tests verify the redaction end-to-end through the monitor.\n\nLab page: Caso D added with GET /api/sensitive and POST /api/login\nbuttons so the redaction behaviour can be verified manually.\n\nCo-Au