,"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maliefrr11","id":192285208,"login":"maliefrr11","node_id":"U_kgDOC3YKGA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/814676f287b8910443c56401555a97afb89d57cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:52:02Z","email":"alief.ramadhan@pasarpolis.com","name":"Moh Alief Rizky Ramadhan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:52:02Z","email":"alief.ramadhan@pasarpolis.com","name":"Moh Alief Rizky Ramadhan"},"message":"chore: release v1.1.1 — pick up the rewritten README on npm\n\nv1.1.0 was published before the docs rewrite landed, so the npmjs.com\npage still shows the old README. Code is unchanged from v1.1.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"001af1f41e7362c8438455e953812ecc4e57a89b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/git/trees/001af1f41e7362c8438455e953812ecc4e57a89b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/git/commits/814676f287b8910443c56401555a97afb89d57cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192285208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maliefrr11","id":192285208,"login":"maliefrr11","node_id":"U_kgDOC3YKGA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commit/814676f287b8910443c56401555a97afb89d57cf","node_id":"C_kwDORGG-udoAKDgxNDY3NmYyODdiODkxMDQ0M2M1NjQwMTU1NWE5N2FmYjg5ZDU3Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commit/b7fc1765d37e95e1281aaa8ae7853faa0e7a7a64","sha":"b7fc1765d37e95e1281aaa8ae7853faa0e7a7a64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/b7fc1765d37e95e1281aaa8ae7853faa0e7a7a64"}],"sha":"814676f287b8910443c56401555a97afb89d57cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/814676f287b8910443c56401555a97afb89d57cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192285208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maliefrr11","id":192285208,"login":"maliefrr11","node_id":"U_kgDOC3YKGA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/b7fc1765d37e95e1281aaa8ae7853faa0e7a7a64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:49:36Z","email":"alief.ramadhan@pasarpolis.com","name":"Moh Alief Rizky Ramadhan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:49:36Z","email":"alief.ramadhan@pasarpolis.com","name":"Moh Alief Rizky Ramadhan"},"message":"docs: rewrite README/INTEGRATION/LIBRARY/MICROFRONTEND for v1.1.0\n\nBring the documentation in line with the current behavior and shipping\nschema:\n\n- npm install instructions point at the published @gamewota/beatmap-editor\n  package; demo + npm + repo links surfaced at the top.\n- Snap convention documented as music notation (1/1 = whole, 1/4 = beat,\n  1/8 = half-beat, 1/16 = quarter-beat) with the visible-lines table.\n- snapEnabled removed from the props table; placement always snaps to\n  the visible grid.\n- Default snap is 1/8.\n- Full beatmap JSON schema reference inline (bpm, offset, charts[uuid,\n  notes, laneCount, links{startNote, endNote full copies}]), including\n  the songPos / beat / offset relationship.\n- Migration note from the pre-1.1.0 button_* shape.\n- Library release flow updated to describe the auto-publish-on-tag\n  workflow (publish-npm job in deploy.yml), NPM_TOKEN setup requirements\n  (Automation token / granular w/ 2FA bypass), and manual fallback.\n- Architecture notes cover dual-canvas rendering, batched grid strokes,\n  shared TimelineViewport, and the new snap math.\n- Web component doc updated for the 1.1.0 attributes and clarifies that\n  internal notes use the React shape while exports use the schema.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"317ba003e65ef0b832a0256ad531eefd9b6d64d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/git/trees/317ba003e65ef0b832a0256ad531eefd9b6d64d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/git/commits/b7fc1765d37e95e1281aaa8ae7853faa0e7a7a64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192285208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maliefrr11","id":192285208,"login":"maliefrr11","node_id":"U_kgDOC3YKGA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commit/b7fc1765d37e95e1281aaa8ae7853faa0e7a7a64","node_id":"C_kwDORGG-udoAKGI3ZmMxNzY1ZDM3ZTk1ZTEyODFhYWE4YWU3ODUzZmFhMGU3YTdhNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commit/749cde2c9a39e79caf6854de6a23102c35a06eab","sha":"749cde2c9a39e79caf6854de6a23102c35a06eab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/749cde2c9a39e79caf6854de6a23102c35a06eab"}],"sha":"b7fc1765d37e95e1281aaa8ae7853faa0e7a7a64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/b7fc1765d37e95e1281aaa8ae7853faa0e7a7a64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192285208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maliefrr11","id":192285208,"login":"maliefrr11","node_id":"U_kgDOC3YKGA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/749cde2c9a39e79caf6854de6a23102c35a06eab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T13:52:00Z","email":"alief.ramadhan@pasarpolis.com","name":"Moh Alief Rizky Ramadhan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T13:52:00Z","email":"alief.ramadhan@pasarpolis.com","name":"Moh Alief Rizky Ramadhan"},"message":"ci: add publish-npm job to deploy.yml on tag pushes\n\nWorkflows triggered by GITHUB_TOKEN cannot trigger other workflows, so\nthe existing publish.yml''s release.created trigger never fires for\nreleases created by deploy.yml. Adding the npm publish step inline as a\ntag-gated job in deploy.yml makes every v* tag push end-to-end:\nbuild → release → npm publish.\n\npublish.yml is kept around for manual workflow_dispatch fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f50906aa80c5d9378f041f8fddacc16d7ff6f853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/git/trees/f50906aa80c5d9378f041f8fddacc16d7ff6f853"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/git/commits/749cde2c9a39e79caf6854de6a23102c35a06eab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192285208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maliefrr11","id":192285208,"login":"maliefrr11","node_id":"U_kgDOC3YKGA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commit/749cde2c9a39e79caf6854de6a23102c35a06eab","node_id":"C_kwDORGG-udoAKDc0OWNkZTJjOWEzOWU3OWNhZjY4NTRkZTZhMjMxMDJjMzVhMDZlYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commit/995e6f91ad2b3737fd4f7b841d633667663655b3","sha":"995e6f91ad2b3737fd4f7b841d633667663655b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/995e6f91ad2b3737fd4f7b841d633667663655b3"}],"sha":"749cde2c9a39e79caf6854de6a23102c35a06eab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/749cde2c9a39e79caf6854de6a23102c35a06eab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192285208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maliefrr11","id":192285208,"login":"maliefrr11","node_id":"U_kgDOC3YKGA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commits/995e6f91ad2b3737fd4f7b841d633667663655b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:09:39Z","email":"alief.ramadhan@pasarpolis.com","name":"Moh Alief Rizky Ramadhan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:09:39Z","email":"alief.ramadhan@pasarpolis.com","name":"Moh Alief Rizky Ramadhan"},"message":"feat: optimize grid rendering, sub-beat subdivisions, new export format\n\n- Eliminate redundant static-canvas redraws on every scroll pixel; the\n  full-width canvas now scrolls natively. Viewport subscriber only\n  redraws on structural changes (zoom, duration, container resize).\n- Batch grid line strokes by tier (measure / beat / sub-beat) and batch\n  tap-note arcs; clear only the visible region on the dynamic canvas.\n- Render sub-beat subdivisions in the static grid driven by snapDivision,\n  using music convention (snap denominator divides the whole note):\n  1/1 = measure, 1/4 = beat, 1/8 = half-beat, 1/16 = quarter-beat.\n- Notes always snap to the visible grid; remove the snap on/off toggle.\n- Replace beatmap export/import with the {bpm, offset, charts[{uuid,\n  notes, laneCount, links}]} schema. Hold notes expand into start/end\n  note pairs + a link; import folds same-lane link pairs back to holds.\n- Skip Pages deploy on tag refs so v* tags don''t fail against the\n  github-pages environment branch protection.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the beatmap JSON schema has changed. Old files in the\nbeatmap.items shape are no longer accepted by import.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69e8e786202be9ae7088fe6154c484d561926b36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/git/trees/69e8e786202be9ae7088fe6154c484d561926b36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamewota/beatmap-editor/git/commits/995e6f91ad2b3737fd4f7b841d633667663655b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192285208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maliefrr11","id":192285208,"login":"maliefrr11","node_id":"U_kgDOC3YKGA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maliefrr11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gamewota/beatmap-editor/commit/995e6f91ad2b3737fd4f7b841d633667663655b3","node_id"