/iamhuwng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng/autoresync/commit/5470ed7527f6c4e165b921aae75ec2f02a745a4c","node_id":"C_kwDORGKCetoAKDU0NzBlZDc1MjdmNmM0ZTE2NWI5MjFhYWU3NWVjMmYwMmE3NDVhNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng/autoresync/commit/da0d80db87717dbe759783d3b5306a623315fd30","sha":"da0d80db87717dbe759783d3b5306a623315fd30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/commits/da0d80db87717dbe759783d3b5306a623315fd30"}],"sha":"5470ed7527f6c4e165b921aae75ec2f02a745a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/commits/5470ed7527f6c4e165b921aae75ec2f02a745a4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217681173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng","id":217681173,"login":"iamhuwng","node_id":"U_kgDODPmNFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/commits/da0d80db87717dbe759783d3b5306a623315fd30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T15:15:30Z","email":"iamhuwng@gmail.com","name":"iamhuwng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T19:21:13Z","email":"iamhuwng@gmail.com","name":"iamhuwng"},"message":"docs: record class delete lifecycle boundary\n\nRead the Codex JSONL transcript for the 2026-07-07 class delete thread instead of relying on summary context. The transcript covered the original /teacher/classes delete failure report, repeated game_sessions permission_denied console warnings, Firebase readback that verified the affected classes were already status=deleted, and the follow-up request to update docs and knowns.\n\nAdd documentation/architecture/teacher-class-management-lifecycle.md as the canonical class lifecycle/delete authority. It records classes/{classId}.status as the delete source of truth, student_classes cleanup as best-effort projection maintenance, and class-backed game_sessions/{classId} rows as legacy shadows only.\n\nRetire the old implied contract that deleting a class must also update game_sessions/{classId}. Extend course/class management, join approval gating, student shell loading, student data-loading, session lifecycle authority, infrastructure rules, README, and the knowns mirror to point future work at the same boundary.\n\nAlso update the RTDB multi-path write knowns pattern with the exception for canonical writes followed by optional cleanup, so future fixes do not put legacy shadow cleanup into a must-succeed lifecycle write.\n\nVerification: npx vitest run src/__tests__/services/classManager.test.ts --reporter=basic passed 35/35; npx eslint src/services/classManager.ts src/__tests__/services/classManager.test.ts passed; npm run lint:mantine passed; git diff --cached --check passed. Knowns CLI validation/search were attempted but blocked because the local knowns install is missing @knowns/win-arm64.\n(cherry picked from commit d6be8994f9a3a9a76ec40a3348fbc76f5043845d)","tree":{"sha":"2881e470f59d282a43f4bc9672334cfaa59ad261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/git/trees/2881e470f59d282a43f4bc9672334cfaa59ad261"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/git/commits/da0d80db87717dbe759783d3b5306a623315fd30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature"