.com/users/iamhuwng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/commits/3d45a8940c5a762d8b6cddb453ef68853c4921ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T12:00:25Z","email":"iamhuwng@gmail.com","name":"iamhuwng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T18:56:05Z","email":"iamhuwng@gmail.com","name":"iamhuwng"},"message":"feat(teacher): add material bulk actions\n\nAdd shared MaterialSelectionToolbar and wire selected-material flows across Teacher Lobby Materials tabs. My Content and Public Library test rows now expose page-level selection; Draft cards, Reading Passage rows, and Book cards use the same selected-count/action surface.\n\nKeep actions type-aware. Selected tests can assign one homework item, simple owned tests delete through the existing test delete path, and Reading V2 masters open the master removal review instead of being force-deleted. Public Library exposes assignment only and disables it with material-specific reasons when the selected public material is not assignable. Reading Passage keeps create-full-test as its unique selected action. Books archive metadata only.\n\nUpdate feature registry actions, architecture docs, Knowns mirrors, observability guidance, and stale PRD/task text so Reading Passage-only selection wording is marked superseded where needed.\n\nVerification: rtk npx eslint src/pages/TeacherLobbyPage.jsx src/pages/TeacherLobbyPage.test.jsx src/components/modern/MaterialSelectionToolbar.jsx src/components/modern/materialListAdapter.js src/config/featureRegistry.ts src/config/featureRegistry.test.ts; rtk git diff --cached --check; browser plugin on http://localhost:5173/lobby confirmed Public Library rows are selectable and show selected-material toolbar. Not run: TeacherLobbyPage.test.jsx suite because it has been OOMing; rtk npx knowns validate could not run because @knowns/win-arm64 is missing.","tree":{"sha":"ce8234b47cbccb331cf250c7a973cb3f2b91b44f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/git/trees/ce8234b47cbccb331cf250c7a973cb3f2b91b44f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/git/commits/3d45a8940c5a762d8b6cddb453ef68853c4921ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217681173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng","id":217681173,"login":"iamhuwng","node_id":"U_kgDODPmNFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng/autoresync/commit/3d45a8940c5a762d8b6cddb453ef68853c4921ad","node_id":"C_kwDORGKCetoAKDNkNDVhODk0MGM1YTc2MmQ4YjZjZGRiNDUzZWY2ODg1M2M0OTIxYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng/autoresync/commit/cae1fabba0c7cb88caa6300be83cc494e51bd0d5","sha":"cae1fabba0c7cb88caa6300be83cc494e51bd0d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/commits/cae1fabba0c7cb88caa6300be83cc494e51bd