/288e1007711c194a0aae23a3c517b988fe6063ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:40:23Z","email":"iamhuwng@gmail.com","name":"iamhuwng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:40:23Z","email":"iamhuwng@gmail.com","name":"iamhuwng"},"message":"feat(listening): unify assessment platform\n\nPRD 0055-0060 listening work now carries authoring, storage, live delivery, result review, and proof-chain changes in one checkpoint.\n\nImplementation areas:\n\n- Add Cloudflare upload worker surfaces for listening authoring, private delivery, upload-session contracts, grants, repositories, lifecycle config validation, and remote-dev Wrangler config.\n\n- Add Functions listening-authoring canonical contracts, lifecycle/save/publish services, Firebase repositories, validation, generated lib output, and service tests.\n\n- Add RTDB rules and client storage services for R2 endpoint resolution, asset commit/delivery/lifecycle/registry/reconciliation/replacement/rollback/metrics, deletion governance, and historical orphan inventory.\n\n- Update live runtime for masterAudioState validation, hydration, sync policy, teacher controls, headphone requests, audio progress, mobile answer/submit sheets, solo delivery, autosave, submission, timer, result review, and practice playback.\n\n- Refresh listening test creation UI, parser, storage, result handling, feature registry, env examples, Firebase config, and Worker routing/config.\n\n- Add security/unit/e2e/load coverage, Playwright PRD configs and fixtures, public local audio fixtures, proof scripts, local/live readback artifacts, and screenshots.\n\n- Update PRD tasks, findings, traceability, implementation logs, design docs, large-file maps, and the temporary authority-sync closure rule.\n\nStaging cleanup:\n\n- Redact raw signed URLs, convert proof outputs to UTF-8, trim proof whitespace, exclude generated/cache artifacts, and remove PEM-shaped fake fixture text.\n\nVerification:\n\n- git diff --cached --check\n\n- npm run check:utf8:staged\n\n- staged common secret-pattern scan\n\n- npm --prefix cloudflare run verify:r2-lifecycle\n\n- npm --prefix r2-backup-worker test (6 files, 37 tests)\n\n- npm --prefix cloudflare test blocked at config load: workerd Unsupported platform: win32 arm64 LE","tree":{"sha":"0ce1201c14b8bf2e839ab740b6a78785264a8c4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/git/trees/0ce1201c14b8bf2e839ab740b6a78785264a8c4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/git/commits/288e1007711c194a0aae23a3c517b988fe6063ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217681173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng","id":217681173,"login":"iamhuwng","node_id":"U_kgDODPmNFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng/autoresync/commit/288e1007711c194a0aae23a3c517b988fe6063ca","node_id":"C_kwDORGKCetoAKDI4OGUxMDA3NzExYzE5NGEwYWFlMjNhM2M1MTdiOTg4ZmU2MDYzY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng/autoresync/commit/dfe02060bf473fb4d60fbb601eba23aaecf534cf","sha":"dfe02060bf473fb4d60fbb601eba23aaecf534cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autore