"name":"iamhuwng"},"message":"refactor(assessment): unify authoring shell and planning docs\n\n- add shared `AssessmentAuthoringSection` component, styles, and\n  focused tests so neutral assessment authoring layout can be reused\n  across reading and listening surfaces without changing display-only\n  behavior\n- update `ListeningTestBuilder`, `ReadingV2SettingsPanel`, and related\n  studio shell styling/tests to adopt shared authoring layout and keep\n  spacing plus accessibility coverage aligned\n- add current-state architecture docs for reading-v2/listening\n  unification and upload-storage authority, then refresh linked\n  implementation logs, runtime notes, and repo guidance to match\n- add PRD-0055 packet, child PRDs 0056-0061, findings, task list,\n  traceability, and review addendum so assessment-platform planning\n  and runtime follow-up work are captured in repo\n- refresh historical conversation records and supporting documentation\n  to preserve planning context for later execution and review\n\nSigned-off-by: iamhuwng <iamhuwng@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"719dd05293d3e8362acfb31161f42d5ccb409505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/git/trees/719dd05293d3e8362acfb31161f42d5ccb409505"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamhuwng/autoresync/git/commits/2ac1a73b64368f146d788c15b15017daa4def554","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217681173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/iamhuwng","id":217681173,"login":"iamhuwng","node_id":"U_kgDODPmNFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamhuwng/orgs","