er":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:20:19Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"chore: prepare release 2.10.0\n\n- Sync vendor/lock: install the patched league/commonmark 2.10.0 already\n  pinned in the lock (resolves 6 advisories) and refresh the lock content\n  hash after the 2.10.0 version bump; composer audit is now clean.\n- Document the self-updater removed-paths manifest and stale-build-asset\n  purge (#308), including the 2.10.0 hardening, in docs/self-updater.md.\n- Make ApplicationUpdateManager tests deterministic across runners by\n  neutralizing the ambient COMPOSER_BINARY that `composer test` exports,\n  which otherwise overrode the composer command two preflight tests\n  configure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c02526acd578da971cbd9cc02778f79a5fc336cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/c02526acd578da971cbd9cc02778f79a5fc336cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/288e68356b3dc6121203debec31410e70e6e6554","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/288e68356b3dc6121203debec31410e70e6e6554","node_id":"C_kwDORGYyi9oAKDI4OGU2ODM1NmIzZGM2MTIxMjAzZGViZWMzMTQxMGU3MGU2ZTY1NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/e97f15b9b37d05c8d9fb872bab702dc616384453","sha":"e97f15b9b37d05c8d9fb872bab702dc616384453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/e97f15b9b37d05c8d9fb872bab702dc616384453"}],"sha":"288e68356b3dc6121203debec31410e70e6e6554","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/288e68356b3dc6121203debec31410e70e6e6554"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/e97f15b9b37d05c8d9fb872bab702dc616384453/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:05:42Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:05:42Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"chore: harden v2.10 review findings before release\n\nAddress the branch-review findings for the 2.10.0 release across the\nComposer-package dependency subsystem, the application self-updater, and\nfederated admin-page registration:\n\n- Composer auto-install is now opt-in (default false) and logs its exact\n  invocation; version constraints must be bounded and stable; a plugin may\n  not require a package the host itself owns; install output is redacted.\n- The self-updater consumes its removed-paths manifest after applying it,\n  protects critical host files from removal, and prunes emptied build-asset\n  directories.\n- Nav entries with no permission fall back to the admin dashboard baseline;\n  a dev/branch install now satisfies a tagged constraint.\n- Bump the package version to 2.10.0 (composer.json + OpenAPI config) and\n  document the release in the changelog.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"613a816ed0d844a51b3c468a2bbc3c25df559794","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/613a816ed0d844a51b3c468a2bbc3c25df559794"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/e97f15b9b37d05c8d9fb872bab702dc616384453","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.c