amework/commit/d87fd94b84ec45e71845624a6969209f53404470","sha":"d87fd94b84ec45e71845624a6969209f53404470","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/d87fd94b84ec45e71845624a6969209f53404470"}],"sha":"ecf3d8d6c44e39c838d5fa30d58f1c0a10b868ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/ecf3d8d6c44e39c838d5fa30d58f1c0a10b868ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/d87fd94b84ec45e71845624a6969209f53404470/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:34:04Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:34:04Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"refactor: harden config-driven application update slug\n\nThe v2.8.0 refactor already moved `ApplicationUpdateManager::getUpdateChecker()`\noff the hard-coded `digital-shopfront-cms` slug and onto\n`config(''cms.updates.application_slug'')`, but three of the issue''s acceptance\ncriteria were left incomplete:\n\n- `(string) config(...)` coalesced a present-but-null/empty key to '''', keying\n  the cache as `cms.application..update_check` and identifying the app to the\n  update source as empty. The generic ''application'' default only applied to a\n  *missing* key. Now trims and falls back to ''application'' for null/empty/\n  non-string values.\n- Added unit tests covering the config-driven slug, the generic default, and\n  the digital-shopfront-cms back-compat override path.\n- Genericized the remaining tenant-specific slug example in\n  UpdateCheckerFactory''s docblock.\n\nCloses #120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28b698c13e4ec882506ae854e4ac9996fb6772a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/28b698c13e4ec882506ae854e4ac9996fb6772a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/d87fd94b84ec45e71845624a6969209f53404470","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: