b-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/57c178a703378c7380c072d4650b294af2fd3587","node_id":"C_kwDORGYyi9oAKDU3YzE3OGE3MDMzNzhjNzM4MGMwNzJkNDY1MGIyOTRhZjJmZDM1ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/2ca262ba02ddcf84978f28146d9543177a7aecf6","sha":"2ca262ba02ddcf84978f28146d9543177a7aecf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/2ca262ba02ddcf84978f28146d9543177a7aecf6"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/807aad3decbb9405d4532d91eafcf004177f0dbf","sha":"807aad3decbb9405d4532d91eafcf004177f0dbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/807aad3decbb9405d4532d91eafcf004177f0dbf"}],"sha":"57c178a703378c7380c072d4650b294af2fd3587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/57c178a703378c7380c072d4650b294af2fd3587"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/807aad3decbb9405d4532d91eafcf004177f0dbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T19:22:37Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T19:22:37Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"fix: address CodeRabbit review on plugin Composer dependencies\n\n- Seat the full regenerated Composer autoload maps (PSR-4, classmap, and\n  eager files) after an install instead of only the declared packages''\n  own PSR-4, so transitive dependencies and all autoload types are usable\n  in the same request; add-only against the live loader to avoid duplicate\n  paths on long-running workers. Autoload seating now runs only when an\n  install actually happened (an already-satisfied requirement needs none).\n- Serialize `composer require` behind an atomic Cache lock so overlapping\n  activations can''t corrupt the host composer.json/composer.lock; fail\n  closed when the lock can''t be acquired.\n- Delete the downloaded update archive on every UpdateManager outcome via\n  a finally block, including the dependency/composer rollback paths.\n\nKept autoInstallComposerDependencies defaulting to true (issue #323''s\nstated use case: install on activation); activation stays admin-gated and\nfail-closed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55456130c517b1582759095f90ee0718e958d4be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/55456130c517b1582759095f90ee0718e958d4be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/807aad3decbb9405d4532d91eafcf004177f0dbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/807aad3decbb9405d4532d91eafcf004177f0dbf","node_id":"C_kwDORGYyi9oAKDgwN2FhZDNkZWNiYjk0MDVkNDUzMmQ5MWVhZmNmMDA0MTc3ZjBkYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/a11fd02f995708585e0ece7bd7b26eebcd639aa7","sha":"a11fd02f995708585e0ece7bd7b26eebcd639aa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/a11fd02f995708585e0ece7bd7b26eebcd639aa7"}],"sha":"807aad3decbb9405d4532d91eafcf004177f0dbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/807aad3decbb9405d4532d91eafcf004177f0dbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/a11fd02f995708585e0ece7bd7b26eebcd639aa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:14:54Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:14:54Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"feat: resolve plugin Composer-package dependencies from Packagist\n\nAdd a `composer` block to plugin.json so a plugin can declare Packagist\ndependencies (`{ \"artisanpack-ui/convertkit\": \"^1.2\" }`) instead of\nvendoring them. The framework validates the block, and at activation\nresolves the constraints against the host''s installed packages (reusing\ncomposer/semver). When a requirement is unmet and auto-install is enabled\n(default), it runs `composer require` in the host root so the dependency\nis added to composer.json/lock and survives a fresh deploy, then registers\nthe vendor PSR-4 prefixes on the live ClassLoader before the plugin''s\nservice provider boots.\n\nThis is the plugin->Composer-package sibling of the plugin->plugin\ndependency work (#45), reusing the resolver/result/exception patterns.\n\nResolves the issue''s open design questions:\n- When: at activation, before any state mutation; shape validated at\n  install/update.\n- Packagist unreachable / lock conflict / missing binary: the install\n  fails closed via ComposerDependencyNotSatisfiedException and the\n  activation unwinds (no half-activated plugin); the update flow restores\n  the previous version through its backup-restore path.\n- Auto-install: config-gated (autoInstallComposerDependencies, default\n  true); disabled + unmet fails closed for hardened hosts.\n- Deactivation/uninstall: brought-in packages are left in place, never\n  auto-removed (the host or another plugin may share them).\n\nHardening from review: `--no-plugins` on the install so a malicious\ntransitive composer-plugin cannot execute during require; OPcache\ninvalidation before reloading installed.php so in-request auto-install\ndoes not spuriously fail on hosts with validate_timestamps=0.\n\nCloses #323\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"208b4689c0c0ba528aec25058c3b9aeab29cdb2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/208b4689c0c0ba528aec25058c3b9aeab29cdb2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/a11fd02f995708585e0ece7bd7b26eebcd639aa7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheB