hat only *existing* recipients are treated as opted in, since\n  the degrade path resolves ids through the users table and drops unknown\n  ids (Getting-Started, Sending-Notifications, CHANGELOG).\n- Replace informal \"fataling\" with \"throwing a fatal error\".","tree":{"sha":"31b733b5779666fa8f06eeffa28a70ec90f15cb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/31b733b5779666fa8f06eeffa28a70ec90f15cb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/ba1d6d0515a36241e41f8736536d117c5a21a9e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/ba1d6d0515a36241e41f8736536d117c5a21a9e2","node_id":"C_kwDORGYyi9oAKGJhMWQ2ZDA1MTVhMzYyNDFlNDFmODczNjUzNmQxMTdjNWEyMWE5ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/d5ec5be198bfe1b1fed9dce6e4b3ebbc7ee3e9e0","sha":"d5ec5be198bfe1b1fed9dce6e4b3ebbc7ee3e9e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/d5ec5be198bfe1b1fed9dce6e4b3ebbc7ee3e9e0"}],"sha":"ba1d6d0515a36241e41f8736536d117c5a21a9e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/ba1d6d0515a36241e41f8736536d117c5a21a9e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/d5ec5be198bfe1b1fed9dce6e4b3ebbc7ee3e9e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T00:20:36Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T00:20:36Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"fix: degrade notification sends when host user model lacks the CMS traits\n\napSendNotification() and apSendNotificationByRole() fataled with\n\"Call to undefined method\" when the host User model did not use\nHasNotifications (notificationPreferences()) or HasRolesAndPermissions\n(roles()). Preference filtering runs on every send, so even a plain\nsend with no roles involved failed without HasNotifications.\n\nNotificationManager now guards both relationships with method_exists():\na model without notificationPreferences() treats every existing\nrecipient as opted in (email path included), and a model without\nroles() matches no users so sendNotificationByRole() returns null\ninstead of throwing. The degrade paths still resolve ids through the\nusers table so unknown ids are dropped, matching the trait-present\npath. Notifications docs now state both trait requirements.\n\nCloses #280","tree":{"sha":"173be37362c9e59d51c64b3421d4be665c36f941","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/173be37362c9e59d51c64b3421d4be665c36f941"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/d5ec5be198bfe1b1fed9dce6e4b3ebbc7ee3e9e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_v