filesystem resolves but Composer''s optimized classmap skips as non-compliant\nand a case-sensitive Linux CI filesystem cannot autoload — surfacing as\n`Class \"…\\RolesTableSeeder\" not found` in UpdateCapabilityTest once the CI\ninstall step was unblocked. No code references the directory by path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e11afb63de31898b8c9c881698b2003b3552a0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/9e11afb63de31898b8c9c881698b2003b3552a0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/d877f617887d597de5cc8195ef273e349628a46d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/d877f617887d597de5cc8195ef273e349628a46d","node_id":"C_kwDORGYyi9oAKGQ4NzdmNjE3ODg3ZDU5N2RlNWNjODE5NWVmMjczZTM0OTYyOGE0NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/d2c7a151b30beedf09115240294d6b523576adf5","sha":"d2c7a151b30beedf09115240294d6b523576adf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/d2c7a151b30beedf09115240294d6b523576adf5"}],"sha":"d877f617887d597de5cc8195ef273e349628a46d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/d877f617887d597de5cc8195ef273e349628a46d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/d2c7a151b30beedf09115240294d6b523576adf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:59:44Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:59:44Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"fix(ci,review): unblock CI install and address CodeRabbit review\n\nCI: bump squizlabs/php_codesniffer 3.11.3 -> ^3.13.6. The pinned 3.11.3 is\naffected by CVE-2026-67434, which Composer now blocks on install; 3.13.6 is\nthe fixed version. Dev-only tool; lint stays green.\n\nCodeRabbit review of PR #307:\n- NavUrl: reject all four leading slash/backslash protocol-relative forms\n  (//, /\\, \\/, \\\\), not just the two slash-leading ones.\n- Persist the extraction-additions ledger from handleUpdateFailure, so a\n  throw mid-extraction still records it for a manual rollback in a fresh\n  process (not only after a clean extraction loop).\n- Plugin UpdateManager: re-validate manifest update values at point of use —\n  run the shared update-source rules before interpolating update.github, and\n  enforce https on the legacy update_url feed before fetching it.\n- resolveAdminPageAction always returns a closure: render a mount point for a\n  component identifier and a 501 for a page with neither view nor component,\n  so a misconfigured plugin page fails on its own route instead of crashing\n  route registration for every request. Docs note updated.\n- Gate GET /themes/updates and /plugins/updates on manage-themes /\n  manage-plugins — update discovery makes synchronous outbound requests.\n- Add forbidden-user (403) coverage on the theme update/activate endpoints\n  and the gated update-check endpoints.\n\nThe cross-package hooks double-fire (HookAliases) remains documented and\ntracked in artisanpack-ui/hooks#16; the correct fix is in the hooks package.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"005f2df334eafc47d2c87a70be7b42fd65446bed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/005f2df334eafc47d2c87a70be7b42fd65446bed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/d2c7a151b30beedf09115240294d6b523576adf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/d2c7a151b30beedf09115240294d6b523576adf5","node_id":"C_kwDORGYyi9oAKGQyYzdhMTUxYjMwYmVlZGYwOTExNTI0MDI5NGQ2YjUyMzU3NmFkZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/ab32fde5098316819aa8edb6a013a7cf044035ce","sha":"ab32fde5098316819aa8edb6a013a7cf044035ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/ab32fde5098316819aa8edb6a013a7cf044035ce"}],"sha":"d2c7a151b30beedf09115240294d6b523576adf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/d2c7a151b30beedf09115240294d6b523576adf5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/ab32fde5098316819aa8edb6a013a7cf044035ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:29:30Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T20:29:30Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"release: apply v2.8.0 pre-release review fixes\n\nApplies every finding from the v2.8.0 pre-release review across the\nself-updater, themes, plugins, and admin/AI modules.\n\nSecurity:\n- Gate plugin/theme/AI mutation endpoints on manage-plugins /\n  manage-themes / cms.ai.use (deny-by-default, seeded to admin) (B1/M9).\n- Add zip-slip + single-slug + uncompressed-size guards to plugin/theme\n  extraction via shared ExtensionArchive (B2/M7).\n- Enforce https + checksum on the legacy plugin update_url path (M8).\n- Coerce admin menu label/title/menuTitle to strings and reject\n  protocol-relative NavUrls (L3/L7); scope the admin re-seed to the\n  framework''s own slugs (L8).\n\nCorrectness:\n- Roll back before lifting maintenance and honour the lift policy on the\n  caught path (H1); make pinned downgrade reachable (H2); enforce\n  min PHP/framework version preflight (C3).\n- Throw on partial rollback extraction (M2); persist the extraction\n  additions ledger for manual rollback (M3); EPERM-aware PID liveness and\n  no-lock concurrency refusal (M1/L6); finish-forward status marker (L6).\n- Plugin update cache: negative-cache failures, invalidate after update,\n  re-compare versions (M5/M6); remove the write-only serialized cache and\n  dead branch (M4); normalize checksums through one helper (L1).\n- ThemesController::update returns 422 keyed by slug; fix admin title\n  double-escape (L2/L4).\n\nRefactor / cleanup:\n- Collapse the duplicated theme/plugin update pipeline into\n  ManagesExtensionUpdates and share ZipUploadRequest (H3/C2).\n- Make the application updater slug configurable and honour\n  current_version_config_key (C6/C4); remove orphaned exception factory;\n  dedup the AI feature-state loop (C3/C5).\n\nDocs updated to match; bump version to 2.8.0 and open the [2.8.0]\nCHANGELOG section. The cross-package hooks dedup finding (L9) is filed as\nartisanpack-ui/hooks#16.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"301e523efd8f4ef8b68c557fc12f56c1f30a4943","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/301e523efd8f4ef8b68c557fc12f56c1f30a4943"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/ab32fde5098316819aa8edb6a013a7cf044035ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin"