tps://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commits/68285e9039b57da820994efb92916b8d08a8b051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T00:33:01Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T00:33:01Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"fix: remove extraction-added files on update rollback\n\nA failed update''s rollback restored every backed-up file but never\nremoved the files the extraction *added*. Because a pre-update snapshot\ncannot capture a file that did not exist when it was taken, every path\nthe release introduced — orphaned controllers, models, and, critically,\nmigrations — survived a rollback that reported success, leaving the tree\na hybrid of the old version''s files and an arbitrary subset of the new\nversion''s additions.\n\nextractUpdate() now records the relative paths it creates that did not\nexist beforehand (overwrites are excluded — the backup restores those),\ncapturing each the moment fopen() creates it so a partial-extraction\norphan is recoverable too. On a successful snapshot restore,\nremoveExtractionAdditions() deletes exactly those paths, re-checking the\nexclusion list, refusing to follow symlinks or touch non-regular files,\nand re-validating realpath containment under base_path() before unlink.\n\nThe ledger is reset at the start of every run, not just in\nextractUpdate(): the manager is a singleton, so on a long-lived queue\nworker one instance drives many runs, and a run that fails before the\nExtract step would otherwise inherit a prior successful run''s ledger and\ndelete its files during rollback.\n\nCloses #272\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7523d26ee19c53ab935be96e244982d474f1d91a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/trees/7523d26ee19c53ab935be96e244982d474f1d91a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/git/commits/68285e9039b57da820994efb92916b8d08a8b051","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/68285e9039b57da820994efb92916b8d08a8b051","node_id":"C_kwDORGYyi9oAKDY4Mjg1ZTkwMzliNTdkYTgyMDk5NGVmYjkyOTE2YjhkMDhhOGIwNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-framework/commit/2626340485e6b790c132144b4b0d6526fab8a1a2","sha":"2626340485e6b790c132144b4b0d6526fab8a1a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/cms-fr