/api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zen4-bit/Proxima/commits/cbf7215b767020362b10e5afe31c5722e833fa84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-14T19:06:38Z","email":"py786656@gmail.com","name":"Zen4-bit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-14T19:06:38Z","email":"py786656@gmail.com","name":"Zen4-bit"},"message":"Fix Claude multi-stream response capture\n\nClaude sends multiple HTTP streams per message (thinking + response).\nProxima was returning partial responses by treating each stream end as\nmessage complete.\n\nChanges:\n- browser-manager.cjs: Added /v1/ URL pattern, use message_stop as\n  completion signal, prevent response clearing between Claude streams,\n  skip isStreaming=false in finally block for Claude\n- main-v2.cjs: Added streaming check to late network capture to prevent\n  returning partial data while Claude is still streaming","tree":{"sha":"6527830e2d9fbe9fc702ed8d7ebd98ca871dd7ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zen4-bit/Proxima/git/trees/6527830e2d9fbe9fc702ed8d7ebd98ca871dd7ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zen4-bit/Proxima/git/commits/cbf7215b767020362b10e5afe31c5722e833fa84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239343912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zen4-bit","id":239343912,"login":"Zen4-bit","node_id":"U_kgDODkQZKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/r