or":{"date":"2026-02-14T15:00:09Z","email":"py786656@gmail.com","name":"Zen4-bit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-14T15:06:36Z","email":"py786656@gmail.com","name":"Zen4-bit"},"message":"v3.0.0 release\n\nProxima v3.0.0\n\nREST API\n  You can now use Proxima from any app, script, or tool.\n  Just POST to localhost:3210/v1/chat/completions  same format as OpenAI.\n  Works with anything that supports custom OpenAI endpoints.\n\nPython & JS SDKs\n  No install needed  just drop proxima.py or proxima.js in your project.\n  One function for everything: client.chat(''hello'', model=''claude'')\n\nNew Tools\n  - math_search / image_search  search with formulas or find images\n  - analyze_file  send local files to any AI for review\n  - show_window / hide_window  control the app from your IDE\n  - new_conversation / get_provider_status  manage sessions via MCP\n\nMulti-AI Compare\n  Send one prompt to all 4 AIs at once, get side-by-side answers.","tree":{"sha":"e960f40badf72a467f5a73fd497e375dd2345005","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zen4-bit/Proxima/git/trees/e960f40badf72a467f5a73fd497e375dd2345005"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zen4-bit/Proxima/git/commits/25795d41be9d817247fb260c27035ffaa8700569","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239343912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zen4-bit","id":239343912,"login":"Zen4-bit","node_id":"U_kgDODkQZKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zen4-bit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github